1
00:00:01,735 --> 00:00:03,904
 ♪ IN THE NOT
 TOO DISTANT FUTURE ♪

2
00:00:03,904 --> 00:00:07,140
 ♪ SOMEWHERE
 IN TIME AND SPACE ♪

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:10,444
 ♪ MIKE NELSON
 AND HIS ROBOT PALS ♪

4
00:00:10,444 --> 00:00:13,347
 ♪ ARE CAUGHT
 IN AN ENDLESS CHASE ♪

5
00:00:13,347 --> 00:00:16,583
 ♪ PURSUED BY A WOMAN
 WHOSE NAME IS PEARL ♪

6
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:19,419
 ♪ AN EVIL GAL WHO WANTS
 TO RULE THE WORLD ♪

7
00:00:19,419 --> 00:00:22,556
 ♪ SHE THREW A FEW THINGS
 IN HER PURSE ♪

8
00:00:22,556 --> 00:00:26,393
 ♪ AND HER ROCKET SHIP
 SHE HUNTS HIM ALL ACROSS
 THE UNIVERSE ♪

9
00:00:26,393 --> 00:00:28,262
I'LL GET YOU!

10
00:00:28,262 --> 00:00:31,899
♪ I'LL SEND HIM
CHEESY MOVIES ♪

11
00:00:31,899 --> 00:00:34,134
♪ THE WORST I CAN FIND ♪

12
00:00:34,134 --> 00:00:35,435
♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

13
00:00:35,435 --> 00:00:37,738
♪ HE'LL HAVE TO SIT
AND WATCH THEM ALL ♪

14
00:00:37,738 --> 00:00:40,007
♪ AND I'LL MONITOR HIS MIND ♪

15
00:00:40,007 --> 00:00:41,441
♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

16
00:00:41,441 --> 00:00:44,378
 ♪ NOW KEEP IN MIND,
 MIKE CAN'T CONTROL ♪

17
00:00:44,378 --> 00:00:47,381
 ♪ WHERE THE MOVIES
 BEGIN OR END ♪

18
00:00:47,381 --> 00:00:50,784
 ♪ HE'LL TRY TO KEEP
 HIS SANITY ♪

19
00:00:50,784 --> 00:00:53,954
 ♪ WITH THE HELP
 OF HIS ROBOT FRIENDS ♪

20
00:00:55,822 --> 00:00:57,224
 ♪ ROBOT ROLL CALL ♪

21
00:00:57,224 --> 00:00:58,892
YOU'RE ON.

22
00:00:58,892 --> 00:01:00,093
OH, MY STARS.

23
00:01:00,093 --> 00:01:01,695
CHECK ME OUT.

24
00:01:01,695 --> 00:01:03,163
I'M DIFFERENT.

25
00:01:03,163 --> 00:01:04,564
 ♪ IF YOU'RE WONDERING HOW ♪

26
00:01:04,564 --> 00:01:06,366
 ♪ HE EATS AND BREATHES ♪

27
00:01:06,366 --> 00:01:09,469
 ♪ AND OTHER SCIENCE FACTS
 LA-LA-LA ♪

28
00:01:09,469 --> 00:01:11,038
 ♪ JUST REPEAT TO YOURSELF ♪

29
00:01:11,038 --> 00:01:12,372
 ♪ "IT'S JUST A SHOW ♪

30
00:01:12,372 --> 00:01:15,575
 ♪ I SHOULD REALLY
 JUST RELAX" ♪

31
00:01:15,575 --> 00:01:18,845
 ♪ FOR... ♪

32
00:01:35,796 --> 00:01:37,531
HI, EVERYONE. WELCOME
TO THE SATELLITE OF LOVE.

33
00:01:37,531 --> 00:01:40,300
- HI.
- YOU'RE PROBABLY WONDERING
WHAT'S UP WITH CROW HERE.

34
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:41,501
I'LL LET HIM EXPLAIN.
GO AHEAD.

35
00:01:41,501 --> 00:01:44,538
EXPLAIN WHAT?
OH YEAH, THE NEST.

36
00:01:44,538 --> 00:01:47,074
UM, YEAH, IT TURNS OUT
THAT THE TOP OF MY HEAD

37
00:01:47,074 --> 00:01:48,408
PROVIDES A PERFECT
NESTING SITE

38
00:01:48,408 --> 00:01:50,777
FOR THE RARE SPIX'S MACAW.

39
00:01:50,777 --> 00:01:52,813
I'VE KNOWN THAT FOR SOME TIME,
BUT THIS IS THE FIRST YEAR

40
00:01:52,813 --> 00:01:54,715
I'VE HAD AN ACTUAL
BROODING MOTHER.

41
00:01:54,715 --> 00:01:57,017
SEE, WHAT I DON'T GET
IS HOW YOU COULD NOT NOTICE THEM

42
00:01:57,017 --> 00:01:59,086
BUILDING A NEST
ON THE TOP OF YOUR HEAD.

43
00:01:59,086 --> 00:02:01,288
WELL, I WAS AWARE
OF SOME ACTIVITY, MIKE,

44
00:02:01,288 --> 00:02:03,423
BUT YOU KNOW,
IT'S THE TOP OF MY HEAD.

45
00:02:03,423 --> 00:02:05,058
I SUPPOSE YOU KNOW
EVERY DETAIL

46
00:02:05,058 --> 00:02:06,860
AT ALL TIMES OF
EVERYTHING HAPPENING

47
00:02:06,860 --> 00:02:09,363
AT THE TOP OF YOUR HEAD.

48
00:02:09,363 --> 00:02:10,564
- I GUESS NOT.
- YEAH, SEE?

49
00:02:10,564 --> 00:02:11,898
WHEN DOES THAT ONE
HATCH, ANYWAY?

50
00:02:11,898 --> 00:02:13,700
WELL, PRETTY SOON, MIKE.
IT'S BEEN THREE WEEKS,

51
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:16,203
AND TO TELL THE TRUTH,
I'LL BE A LITTLE RELIEVED.

52
00:02:16,203 --> 00:02:19,106
THE SPIX'S MACAW
IS NOT A SMALL BIRD.

53
00:02:19,106 --> 00:02:20,640
SO WHEN THE MOTHER'S
ACTUALLY HERE,

54
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,676
SITTING ON MY HEAD
WITH THAT BROODING SPOT

55
00:02:22,676 --> 00:02:25,545
ALL PINK AND WARM,
THERE'S NO FEATHERS--

56
00:02:25,545 --> 00:02:28,648
- [MACAW CAWS]
- WHOA, HERE SHE COMES AGAIN.

57
00:02:28,648 --> 00:02:31,018
AH, DAMN, ANOTHER ONE.

58
00:02:31,018 --> 00:02:33,153
RIGHT, WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

59
00:02:33,153 --> 00:02:34,721
MIKE, WOULD YOU MIND
DOING THIS ONE?

60
00:02:34,721 --> 00:02:37,457
I FEEL LIKE I'VE DONE MY PART
FOR THE SPIX'S MACAW.

61
00:02:37,457 --> 00:02:38,792
WELL, YOU'RE THE ONE
WITH THE PERFECT

62
00:02:38,792 --> 00:02:40,761
- NESTING SITE HEAD.
- D'AH...

63
00:02:48,268 --> 00:02:49,936
BACK! GET AWAY, YOU RABBLE!

64
00:02:49,936 --> 00:02:51,204
CEASE AND DESIST!

65
00:02:51,204 --> 00:02:52,973
BACK, I SAY!

66
00:02:52,973 --> 00:02:54,641
OKAY, THEN, YOU MONGRELS.

67
00:02:54,641 --> 00:02:56,476
[GUNSHOTS]

68
00:03:00,013 --> 00:03:01,815
[CROW LAUGHS]

69
00:03:01,815 --> 00:03:04,484
- EAT IT.
- CROW, EVERYTHING ALL RIGHT?

70
00:03:04,484 --> 00:03:06,853
UH, YEAH, I HAD A LITTLE
WEASEL PROBLEM THERE, MIKE.

71
00:03:06,853 --> 00:03:08,955
THEY WERE TRYING TO STEAL
MY POOR LITTLE EGGS.

72
00:03:08,955 --> 00:03:10,557
YOU KNOW,
I NEVER KNEW WEASELS

73
00:03:10,557 --> 00:03:13,693
COULD BE SUCH WEASELS.

74
00:03:13,693 --> 00:03:15,662
PEARL'S GOONS
ARE CALLING. YELLO?

75
00:03:15,662 --> 00:03:19,166
WHAT, DO YOU WANT
A LITTLE MORE?

76
00:03:19,166 --> 00:03:20,534
ALL RIGHT, SPORTO, THIS TIME

77
00:03:20,534 --> 00:03:23,737
YOU ARE ONE DEAD MONKEY.

78
00:03:23,737 --> 00:03:25,772
ONE, TWO THREE.

79
00:03:25,772 --> 00:03:27,941
OH!

80
00:03:27,941 --> 00:03:29,576
GOSH. ALL RIGHT,

81
00:03:29,576 --> 00:03:32,813
BEST OUT OF 99, THEN?

82
00:03:32,813 --> 00:03:35,882
OH, HELLO, DISTURBINGLY
UNHAIRY ONES.

83
00:03:35,882 --> 00:03:37,451
[BOBO LAUGHS]

84
00:03:37,451 --> 00:03:39,252
THE LAWGIVER IS STILL GONE.

85
00:03:39,252 --> 00:03:43,056
[ALL CHEER]

86
00:03:43,056 --> 00:03:45,959
I MEAN, THAT'S...
THAT'S A SHAME.

87
00:03:45,959 --> 00:03:47,461
- DOGGONE IT.
- REALLY.

88
00:03:47,461 --> 00:03:51,231
BUT STAY TUNED FOR THIS
IMPORTANT MESSAGE FROM HER.

89
00:03:51,231 --> 00:03:53,266
OKAY, RUBBER-ARMS,
PATCH HER IN.

90
00:03:53,266 --> 00:03:55,669
YES, ACCESSING

91
00:03:55,669 --> 00:03:58,805
SATELLITE RELAY
TO LOS ANGELES.

92
00:03:58,805 --> 00:04:00,974
COME IN, PEARL.
PEARL, COME IN?

93
00:04:00,974 --> 00:04:02,843
COME IN, PEARL.
PEARL, COME IN.

94
00:04:02,843 --> 00:04:04,911
CALM DOWN, BRAINIAC.

95
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:06,279
YEAH. HI, EVERYONE.

96
00:04:06,279 --> 00:04:07,914
I FLEW THE VAN
OUT HERE TO L.A.

97
00:04:07,914 --> 00:04:09,349
TO TRY AND FIND
SOME MORE MOVIES

98
00:04:09,349 --> 00:04:11,051
TO TORTURE YOU GUYS WITH.

99
00:04:11,051 --> 00:04:12,452
THOUGHT I'D CONSULT
AN EXPERT,

100
00:04:12,452 --> 00:04:13,887
SO I TOOK AND WENT
AND GONE AND GOT

101
00:04:13,887 --> 00:04:16,089
THIS GUY FROM
 ENTERTAINMENT TONIGHT.

102
00:04:16,089 --> 00:04:18,391
HELLO, MIKE.
HELLO, SMALL ROBOTS.

103
00:04:18,391 --> 00:04:19,593
HOW CAN I HELP?

104
00:04:19,593 --> 00:04:20,927
LEONARD MALTIN?

105
00:04:20,927 --> 00:04:22,729
PEARL, YOU ARE CONNECTED.

106
00:04:22,729 --> 00:04:24,731
EXCUSE ME, MR. MALTIN.
WHAT DO YOU MAKE

107
00:04:24,731 --> 00:04:27,801
OF THE STYLISTIC RESURGENCE
OF ITALIAN NEOREALIST FILMMAKING

108
00:04:27,801 --> 00:04:30,303
IN THE VEIN OF DE SICA'S
 UMBERTO D?

109
00:04:30,303 --> 00:04:31,972
YEAH, MALTIN, IS IT TRUE

110
00:04:31,972 --> 00:04:33,673
THAT THEY'RE WORKING ON
YET ANOTHER REMAKE

111
00:04:33,673 --> 00:04:35,375
OF THE FISH THAT
 SAVED PITTSBURGH?

112
00:04:35,375 --> 00:04:36,676
OH, YEAH.

113
00:04:36,676 --> 00:04:39,412
STOP BUGGING MR. SISKEL
WITH QUESTIONS.

114
00:04:39,412 --> 00:04:41,448
- MALTIN.
- HE'S HELPING ME.

115
00:04:41,448 --> 00:04:44,084
SO, WHAT DO YOU
RECOMMEND, ROGER?

116
00:04:44,084 --> 00:04:46,086
LEONARD.
I'D HIGHLY RECOMMEND

117
00:04:46,086 --> 00:04:48,522
THE 1961
MONSTER MOVIE GORGO.

118
00:04:48,522 --> 00:04:51,625
IT'S SORT OF A BRITISH TAKE
ON THE GODZILLA THING.

119
00:04:51,625 --> 00:04:53,860
UH, MR. MALTIN,

120
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:56,129
IS GORGO REALLY THAT BAD?
I MEAN...

121
00:04:56,129 --> 00:04:58,799
YOU'RE NOT REALLY GONNA
HURT US, ARE YOU?

122
00:04:58,799 --> 00:05:00,534
WELL, THAT'S A MATTER
OF OPINION, MIKE.

123
00:05:00,534 --> 00:05:01,802
NOW, I ACTUALLY LIKE GORGO,

124
00:05:01,802 --> 00:05:03,403
BUT WHEN WE REVIEWED
FOR MY NUMBER ONE 

125
00:05:03,403 --> 00:05:05,205
BEST-SELLING
MOVIE AND VIDEO GUIDE,

126
00:05:05,205 --> 00:05:06,807
IT PUT TWO OF MY
ASSISTANT EDITORS

127
00:05:06,807 --> 00:05:09,276
INTO INTENSIVE CARE.
SO WHO KNOWS?

128
00:05:09,276 --> 00:05:11,778
BESIDES, PEARL PROMISED ME
A LIGHT LUNCH AT SKYBAR.

129
00:05:11,778 --> 00:05:13,446
NO... I SAID

130
00:05:13,446 --> 00:05:15,682
ONE APPETIZER ONLY, EBERT.

131
00:05:15,682 --> 00:05:17,784
- MALTIN.
- OKAY, MR. MALTIN EBERT.

132
00:05:17,784 --> 00:05:19,753
DON'T PUSH YOUR LUCK,
OR IT'S A SMALL DECAF

133
00:05:19,753 --> 00:05:21,721
AT STARBUCKS.

134
00:05:21,721 --> 00:05:23,056
BRAIN GUY?

135
00:05:23,056 --> 00:05:24,824
OH, YES, PEARL?

136
00:05:24,824 --> 00:05:26,793
- DO YOU MIND?
- ME? NOT AT ALL.

137
00:05:26,793 --> 00:05:29,296
THANK YOU.

138
00:05:29,296 --> 00:05:31,698
OKAY. AND...

139
00:05:31,698 --> 00:05:33,400
GO-- OH!

140
00:05:36,269 --> 00:05:37,537
HEY, CROW,
YOUR EGGS ARE GONE.

141
00:05:37,537 --> 00:05:38,872
UH, YEAH,
THEY GOT TAKEN AWAY

142
00:05:38,872 --> 00:05:40,574
BY EGG PROTECTIVE SERVICES.

143
00:05:40,574 --> 00:05:42,409
I ACCIDENTALLY MADE
AN OMELET IN FRONT OF THEM.

144
00:05:42,409 --> 00:05:43,777
IT KIND OF SPOOKED THEM.

145
00:05:43,777 --> 00:05:45,078
YEAH, WELL, I HOPE YOU
GET TO VISIT--

146
00:05:45,078 --> 00:05:46,413
OH, WE GOT MOVIE SIGN!

147
00:05:46,413 --> 00:05:48,114
CURSE YOU, MALTIN!

148
00:06:01,394 --> 00:06:03,763
- WOW.
- WHAT HAVE WE GOT HERE?

149
00:06:03,763 --> 00:06:05,131
[MIKE MUMBLES]

150
00:06:05,131 --> 00:06:06,967
LONDON, ENGLAND.
YEAH, WHICH WAS PAID FOR

151
00:06:06,967 --> 00:06:10,337
BY EXORBITANT TAXES ON
ROD STEWART AND PETE TOWNSEND.

152
00:06:10,337 --> 00:06:13,173
[CROW SCOFFS]

153
00:06:13,173 --> 00:06:16,243
WAIT, I JUST GOT
THREE WORDS INTO IT.

154
00:06:16,243 --> 00:06:21,514
WHAT A TERRIBLE NAME
FOR A MOVIE.

155
00:06:21,514 --> 00:06:22,649
THE VICE PRESIDENT'S

156
00:06:22,649 --> 00:06:26,553
UNIMAGINATIVE
CAMPAIGN SLOGAN.

157
00:06:26,553 --> 00:06:28,221
GOOD MASONRY WORK
ON THE TITLES.

158
00:06:28,221 --> 00:06:32,692
IT WAS DONE BY THE GUYS
AT MARK 7 PRODUCTIONS.

159
00:06:32,692 --> 00:06:35,996
[MIKE SIGHS]

160
00:06:35,996 --> 00:06:38,698
♪ OH GORGO BOY ♪

161
00:06:38,698 --> 00:06:40,267
♪ THE GOR THE GOR ♪

162
00:06:40,267 --> 00:06:42,903
♪ IS GOING ♪

163
00:06:42,903 --> 00:06:45,905
♪ FROM GOR TO GOR ♪

164
00:06:45,905 --> 00:06:48,642
F.A. YOUNG
LOVES P.A. YOUNG.

165
00:06:55,649 --> 00:06:57,651
OH YEAH, YOU KNOW,
NAME YOUR KID MUIR MATHIESON,

166
00:06:57,651 --> 00:06:59,252
HE'S PRETTY MUCH
DESTINED TO CONDUCT

167
00:06:59,252 --> 00:07:01,354
- THE SINFONIA OF LONDON.
- MM-HMM.

168
00:07:01,354 --> 00:07:03,356
THE LOST STOOGE.

169
00:07:06,693 --> 00:07:08,495
HMM.

170
00:07:08,495 --> 00:07:11,564
YEAH, YEAH, AND ALL THESE OTHER
GOONS FROM THE SCEPTERED ISLE.

171
00:07:11,564 --> 00:07:13,733
LET'S MOVE ON.

172
00:07:16,503 --> 00:07:19,706
♪ DOWN WITH THE OLD ♪

173
00:07:19,706 --> 00:07:22,676
♪ FOLKS AT HOME ♪

174
00:07:22,676 --> 00:07:24,344
JEEZ, PAUL ROBESON.

175
00:07:24,344 --> 00:07:26,012
LOVELY.

176
00:07:26,012 --> 00:07:28,815
OH, HAWAII 5-0 USED TO HAVE
REALLY DIFFERENT CREDITS.

177
00:07:32,385 --> 00:07:34,220
FRANK KING! MAURICE KING!

178
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:35,655
ADMINISTRATION.

179
00:07:35,655 --> 00:07:37,190
DID FRANK SNEAK IN
AFTERWARDS

180
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:41,061
AND PUT THAT LITTLE DIG
UNDER MAURICE'S NAME?

181
00:07:41,061 --> 00:07:42,395
I THINK THAT SHIP'S PC VALVE

182
00:07:42,395 --> 00:07:45,432
IS A LITTLE OFF THERE.

183
00:07:45,432 --> 00:07:47,567
WITHOUT A HARD TACK!

184
00:07:50,937 --> 00:07:53,907
POOP DECK PAPPY.
THE REAL STORY.

185
00:07:53,907 --> 00:07:56,076
[SERVO WHISTLES]

186
00:07:56,076 --> 00:07:58,445
SAM. IT'S LOOKING
TERRIBLY UGLY.

187
00:07:58,445 --> 00:07:59,779
WELL, THANKS A LOT.

188
00:07:59,779 --> 00:08:01,247
THE MEN ARE GETTING EDGY.

189
00:08:01,247 --> 00:08:02,849
YEAH, SO AM I.

190
00:08:02,849 --> 00:08:05,285
NEED ANY FREELANCE
FROG-MANNING SERVICES?

191
00:08:05,285 --> 00:08:09,923
COME ON, JOE,
MAKE IT SNAPPY, WILL YA?

192
00:08:09,923 --> 00:08:11,057
COME ON.
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.

193
00:08:11,057 --> 00:08:12,459
WAIT A MINUTE, SAM.

194
00:08:12,459 --> 00:08:13,860
THERE'S THOUSANDS OF DOLLARS
WORTH OF STUFF

195
00:08:13,860 --> 00:08:15,161
IN THAT OLD RUST BUCKET.

196
00:08:15,161 --> 00:08:16,730
I'M NOT GETTING OUT OF HERE
WITHOUT IT.

197
00:08:16,730 --> 00:08:19,466
- ARE YOU KIDDING?
- [SERVO] WE HAVE
TO GO FIND ROBERT DENBY.

198
00:08:19,466 --> 00:08:23,203
STOP WORRYING. TAKE IT OUT
AND BE BACK UP IN TEN MINUTES.

199
00:08:23,203 --> 00:08:27,474
- I SHOULD MOISTURIZE.
- [SERVO CHUCKLES]

200
00:08:29,843 --> 00:08:32,946
[MIKE] I THINK THE POOL GUY
OVER-CHLORINATED THE OCEAN HERE.

201
00:08:32,946 --> 00:08:36,349
OOF. THIS NEW QUARTER-INCH
FLAVORED SCUBA AIR

202
00:08:36,349 --> 00:08:38,518
ISN'T VERY GOOD.

203
00:08:41,821 --> 00:08:43,957
[SERVO IMITATING GHOST]
WHOO-OO-OO...

204
00:08:43,957 --> 00:08:47,293
[CROW] A LEGENDARY
LOST TREASURE OF CAP'N CRUNCH.

205
00:08:51,931 --> 00:08:53,900
[SERVO] LOOK, HE CARRIES HIS
OWN LITTLE ESPRESSO MACHINE

206
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:55,368
ON HIS BACK WITH HIM.

207
00:08:56,803 --> 00:08:58,772
SOMEBODY'S GOT TO GET ON
THE OTHER SIDE OF THE BOAT,

208
00:08:58,772 --> 00:09:00,774
OR WE'RE IN TROUBLE, GUYS.

209
00:09:03,109 --> 00:09:05,378
THEY'VE BEEN DOWN
HALF AN HOUR.

210
00:09:05,378 --> 00:09:08,481
I KNOW THESE WATERS WELL, SAM. 
I'VE NEVER SEEN THE LIKE
OF THIS BEFORE.

211
00:09:08,481 --> 00:09:11,184
[SERVO]
THIS PUTS MY HAT OUT OF SHAPE.

212
00:09:11,184 --> 00:09:13,019
GET ME A LUNG.
I'M GOING DOWN TO GET HIM.

213
00:09:14,788 --> 00:09:18,892
- HE'S COME UP!
- [SERVO GASPS] I PUT
THE PROPANE TANKS ON BY MISTAKE!

214
00:09:23,163 --> 00:09:26,099
IT'S-- IT'S ROBERT MAXWELL!
HE'S ALIVE!

215
00:09:26,099 --> 00:09:28,401
- [SERVO] AAH.
- COME FORWARD, GARRETT!

216
00:09:33,306 --> 00:09:35,875
OUR GAME OF RISK!

217
00:09:38,545 --> 00:09:41,648
UH, MIKE? SERVO? FOR WHAT
IT'S WORTH, MY HEART WILL GO ON.

218
00:09:41,648 --> 00:09:43,683
- GOOD.
- OKAY.

219
00:09:46,586 --> 00:09:48,688
[SERVO LAUGHS]

220
00:09:48,688 --> 00:09:50,457
[MIKE] YOU KNOW, WHEN THIS BOAT
WAS LAUNCHED, IT WAS PROMOTED

221
00:09:50,457 --> 00:09:52,592
AS PRETTY DAMNED SINKABLE.

222
00:09:55,695 --> 00:09:57,864
REACHING US OVER EASY.

223
00:09:59,933 --> 00:10:01,401
WHOO.

224
00:10:01,401 --> 00:10:05,038
YEAH, IT'S ROUGH, BUT IS IT
REALLY TOO ROUGH TO FEED US?

225
00:10:07,073 --> 00:10:08,908
[SERVO]
I'M DROWNING AND I'M WET.

226
00:10:14,013 --> 00:10:15,815
GARY, I'M STEERING!

227
00:10:17,984 --> 00:10:20,353
GREAT, NOW OUR
TOOTHPICK SCULPTURE.

228
00:10:22,322 --> 00:10:23,957
LET GO-O-O!

229
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:29,896
[SERVO] MAN, THIS IS WORSE
THAN WHEN AUSTRALIA FORMED

230
00:10:29,896 --> 00:10:32,031
RIGHT NEXT TO US.

231
00:10:33,766 --> 00:10:35,502
[CROW] "DON'T WORRY, SIR.
TURNS OUT SHELLEY WINTERS

232
00:10:35,502 --> 00:10:37,137
IS A VERY GOOD SWIMMER."

233
00:10:39,272 --> 00:10:41,641
- [MIKE] WHAT? [LAUGHS]
- AND...

234
00:10:41,641 --> 00:10:43,776
- OH, THEY'RE FINE. OKAY.
- [GIGGLING]

235
00:10:43,776 --> 00:10:46,713
♪ THEY GOT INTO PORN
AND EVERYONE WAS OKAY ♪

236
00:10:46,713 --> 00:10:49,716
♪ THEY WENT OUT FOR LUNCH
AND FELT BETTER ♪

237
00:10:51,017 --> 00:10:53,353
- [SERVO] HEY, MIKE NELSON!
- HEY, TOM SERVO.

238
00:10:53,353 --> 00:10:55,321
NO, I MEAN THE-- NEVER MIND.

239
00:10:58,825 --> 00:11:00,760
- DUM, DUM--
- HI.

240
00:11:05,131 --> 00:11:06,332
[SERVO] I'M SURE IT'S FINE.

241
00:11:06,332 --> 00:11:08,768
I DON'T KNOW MUCH ABOUT
PROPELLERS, ANYWAY.

242
00:11:08,768 --> 00:11:11,638
WELL, I GUESS I SHOULDN'T
HAVE THROWN THE CAPTAIN'S
HAT OVERBOARD.

243
00:11:11,638 --> 00:11:15,842
HE WASN'T PLEASED.

244
00:11:15,842 --> 00:11:19,112
WELL, THERE'S WATER
IN THE BASEMENT,
THE CARPET'S ALL RUINED.

245
00:11:19,112 --> 00:11:22,382
- NOT AS BAD AS I THOUGHT, JOE.
- HOW LONG TO GET IT INTO SHAPE?

246
00:11:23,783 --> 00:11:26,319
THE RUDDER STOCK'S BENT.
A COUPLE OF SPRUNG PLATES.

247
00:11:26,319 --> 00:11:29,088
- UH-HUH.
- THAT MESS ON DECK,
THREE, FOUR DAYS.

248
00:11:29,088 --> 00:11:32,058
- AND WE'RE OUT OF FRESH WATER.
- [SERVO] WE'LL HAVE TO DRINK
CONCENTRATE, THEN.

249
00:11:32,058 --> 00:11:34,160
LET'S GO ASHORE AND SEE WHAT
THEY'VE GOT, EH, SAM?

250
00:11:37,430 --> 00:11:40,833
[SERVO] YES, LET'S PUT ON
SOME OLD SPICE AND GO ASHORE.

251
00:11:40,833 --> 00:11:43,436
♪♪ [WHISTLING THEME
TO "OLD SPICE"]

252
00:11:44,571 --> 00:11:47,240
THERE'S DEAD COWS
IN THE WATER.

253
00:11:50,777 --> 00:11:52,545
LOOK THERE.

254
00:11:52,545 --> 00:11:53,980
A TUNA SWALLOWED
AN ARMADILLO?

255
00:11:55,214 --> 00:11:57,650
I'VE NEVER SEEN ANYTHING
LIKE THAT BEFORE. 

256
00:11:57,650 --> 00:12:00,620
SOME KIND OF COELACANTH DEATH
CULT, OR SOMETHING, YOU KNOW?

257
00:12:02,755 --> 00:12:05,425
WELL, LET'S SELL IT
TO THE JAPANESE FOR $60,000.

258
00:12:06,693 --> 00:12:09,963
THE WHOLE OCEAN BOTTOM
MUST HAVE BEEN TORN UP

259
00:12:09,963 --> 00:12:13,132
[CROW] UGH. CAN I WIPE
ON YOUR JACKET, PLEASE?

260
00:12:14,367 --> 00:12:16,669
WOW. NEW ISLAND GOT
SETTLED VERY QUICKLY.

261
00:12:16,669 --> 00:12:20,206
- AND HOW.
- LICE FOR SALE!
SUGARS AND LICE!

262
00:12:26,546 --> 00:12:28,114
LOOKS LIKE THEY WERE
PRETTY HARD HIT.

263
00:12:28,114 --> 00:12:30,817
- YEAH.
- POOR DOPES. THEY APPEAR
EVERY HUNDRED YEARS

264
00:12:30,817 --> 00:12:33,186
- AND GET HIT BY A HUGE STORM.
- HI.

265
00:12:33,186 --> 00:12:34,887
IS THERE A HARBORMASTER
WE CAN TALK TO?

266
00:12:34,887 --> 00:12:36,189
[SPEAKING FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

267
00:12:36,189 --> 00:12:38,524
- SOMETHING ABOUT A KNISH?
- OOH.

268
00:12:38,524 --> 00:12:40,860
GAELIC, HUH?

269
00:12:40,860 --> 00:12:43,229
DOESN'T SOUND LIKE "WELCOME"
IN ANY LANGUAGE.

270
00:12:43,229 --> 00:12:45,498
HOW DO YOU GET YOUR SHIRTS
SO WHITE, SEAMUS?

271
00:12:51,204 --> 00:12:53,106
STAY QUIET, MAN.

272
00:12:54,874 --> 00:12:57,277
HEY, KID.
YOUR FATHER AT HOME?

273
00:12:57,277 --> 00:13:01,547
- I DON'T HAVE A FATHER.
- OH. DOES THE HARBORMASTER
LIVE HERE?

274
00:13:01,547 --> 00:13:03,783
IT'S THE RIGHT PLACE
YOU'VE COME TO, THEN. COME IN.

275
00:13:03,783 --> 00:13:06,753
DID YOU SEE ME IN
"HOW GREEN WAS MY VALLEY"?

276
00:13:09,889 --> 00:13:13,092
ME MUM'S AT WORK, SO I'M HAVIN'
A GARAGE SALE WITH HER STUFF.

277
00:13:13,092 --> 00:13:15,495
YOU SAY THE HARBORMASTER
LIVES HERE?

278
00:13:15,495 --> 00:13:19,399
YES. BUT THERE'S A CITY MAN
HERE. A GOVERNMENT MAN.

279
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:21,601
- WHO IS HE? WHAT'S HE DO?
- McCARTIN'S HIS NAME.

280
00:13:21,601 --> 00:13:24,437
CALLS HIMSELF AN, UH--
OCULIST.

281
00:13:24,437 --> 00:13:28,174
- WHAT'S YOUR NAME?
- SEAN. I WORK FOR HIM.

282
00:13:28,174 --> 00:13:32,245
- DOING WHAT?
- WELL, A BIT OF THIS,
AND A BIT OF THAT.

283
00:13:32,245 --> 00:13:34,747
PINNING UP THE THINGS HE FINDS.

284
00:13:34,747 --> 00:13:37,583
- WHAT THINGS?
- WANT TO SEE THEM, THEN?

285
00:13:37,583 --> 00:13:38,918
YEAH, SURE.

286
00:13:38,918 --> 00:13:41,454
YOU KNOW, HE LOOKS LIKE
A CHIMP THAT'S DRESSED UP.

287
00:13:43,389 --> 00:13:44,691
♪ DOO, DOO-DOO ♪

288
00:13:50,897 --> 00:13:54,167
HEY, LOOK OVER THERE: IT'S AN
ANCIENT CELTIC WAFFLE IRON.

289
00:13:54,167 --> 00:13:56,302
COOL.

290
00:13:56,302 --> 00:13:59,806
UH, KID, HOW DOES THIS HUGE ROOM
FIT INTO THIS TINY LITTLE HUT?

291
00:14:02,241 --> 00:14:04,243
♪♪ [WHISTLES]
WELL, WHAT DO YOU KNOW?

292
00:14:04,243 --> 00:14:06,179
[ALL TOGETHER]
"NOT MUCH, YOU?"

293
00:14:09,349 --> 00:14:12,051
THAT'S BEEN UNDER THE SEA
A THOUSAND YEARS, THEY SAY.

294
00:14:12,051 --> 00:14:13,986
- HMM?
- VIKING, LOOKS LIKE.

295
00:14:13,986 --> 00:14:16,255
- YEAH?
- THAT'S IT.

296
00:14:16,255 --> 00:14:18,491
IT WAS A GREAT SEA BATTLE,
RIGHT OFF THE BAY HERE.

297
00:14:18,491 --> 00:14:21,561
- THAT'S G-R-REAT.
- AND RORY DROVE THEM OFF,
AND SANK THEIR SHIPS.

298
00:14:21,561 --> 00:14:24,931
- WHAT'S THAT?
- OH, THAT'S A DUCK WE GAVE
BOVINE GROWTH HORMONE.

299
00:14:27,533 --> 00:14:30,503
THAT'S ELGRA, THE SEA SPIRIT.

300
00:14:30,503 --> 00:14:33,339
FINE WORK HE DID THAT DAY.

301
00:14:33,339 --> 00:14:35,608
SOUNDS LIKE ST. PATRICK
AND THE SNAKES.

302
00:14:35,608 --> 00:14:37,543
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

303
00:14:37,543 --> 00:14:39,479
- YOU GET OUT.
- SAMUEL BECKETT!

304
00:14:41,414 --> 00:14:44,183
I'M JOE RYAN.
THAT'S MY PARTNER, SAM SLADE.

305
00:14:44,183 --> 00:14:47,186
- HI.
- McCARTIN'S THE NAME.

306
00:14:47,186 --> 00:14:49,889
- SALVAGE VESSEL, AREN'T YOU?
- YEAH.

307
00:14:49,889 --> 00:14:51,791
I THOUGHT SO.

308
00:14:51,791 --> 00:14:53,626
DID THE BOY TELL YOU
ABOUT ALL THIS?

309
00:14:53,626 --> 00:14:56,529
- YEAH, A LITTLE.
- THIS STUFF HAS NO REAL VALUE.

310
00:14:56,529 --> 00:14:59,432
EXCEPT TO US EGGHEADS.
BUT SINCE IT TURNED UP,

311
00:14:59,432 --> 00:15:01,067
NO SHIPS ALLOWED
AT NYDA ISLAND

312
00:15:01,067 --> 00:15:03,035
FOR MORE THAN 24 HOURS
WITHOUT A PERMIT.

313
00:15:03,035 --> 00:15:05,838
LOOK, FRIEND,
WE'RE NOT SEAWORTHY.

314
00:15:05,838 --> 00:15:07,607
WE WON'T BE
FOR THREE OR FOUR DAYS.

315
00:15:07,607 --> 00:15:11,344
I DON'T MAKE THE LAW.
THAT'S THE WAY IT IS.

316
00:15:11,344 --> 00:15:13,646
ANYWAY, WE'RE AFLOAT.
COME ON, SAM.

317
00:15:13,646 --> 00:15:16,883
WE'LL GO FIND
A BETTER HARBOR MASTER. 

318
00:15:16,883 --> 00:15:20,086
- HOW ABOUT FRESH WATER?
- WE'LL GIVE YOU THAT.

319
00:15:20,086 --> 00:15:22,121
- THANKS.
- NO HARD FEELINGS, NOW.

320
00:15:22,121 --> 00:15:25,224
- OH, NO.
- NOW, WAIT. YOU GUYS,
I THINK THERE MIGHT BE.

321
00:15:25,224 --> 00:15:27,160
PLEASE, LET'S TALK THIS OUT!

322
00:15:29,428 --> 00:15:31,798
YOU BELIEVE HIM,
ABOUT THOSE PERMITS?

323
00:15:33,032 --> 00:15:35,301
- NO.
- WELL, SOMETHING'S EATING HIM.

324
00:15:35,301 --> 00:15:38,004
- YOU MEAN, BESIDES THE LICE?
- I WONDER WHAT.

325
00:15:39,105 --> 00:15:41,274
I DON'T KNOW.

326
00:15:41,274 --> 00:15:44,677
COME ON. MAYBE WE'LL SWING
A LITTLE MORE WEIGHT AROUND HERE

327
00:15:44,677 --> 00:15:47,680
- IF WE FIND OUT.
- BUT LET'S GET SOME
BOILED CABBAGE FIRST.

328
00:15:50,416 --> 00:15:52,885
AH, IT'S THE YEARLY
SELKIE CLUBBIN'.

329
00:15:54,821 --> 00:15:56,556
HEY, JOE, LOOK!

330
00:15:56,556 --> 00:15:59,292
HE'S NEW TO SAILORING, AND HE'S
STILL POINTING OUT BOATS.

331
00:16:02,862 --> 00:16:05,531
- BACK 'ER OFF, HARRY.
- I BEG YOUR PARDON?

332
00:16:06,666 --> 00:16:09,368
OH, WE'RE A TERRIBLE CREW TEAM.

333
00:16:10,469 --> 00:16:12,171
ARE YOU HAVING ANY LUCK?

334
00:16:12,171 --> 00:16:14,807
- I'VE GOT SOME [FOREIGN WORD].
- HMM! WOW.

335
00:16:14,807 --> 00:16:17,877
YOU KNOW, JOE, THEY CAN
TALK ENGLISH EVERY BIT
AS GOOD AS YOU OR I CAN.

336
00:16:17,877 --> 00:16:19,378
THEY JUST DON'T WANT TO,
THAT'S ALL.

337
00:16:19,378 --> 00:16:22,982
- YOU TRY 'EM, HARRY.
- [SPEAKING FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

338
00:16:22,982 --> 00:16:25,585
YOU HAVE A GOOD TIME
TO HEAR OF NECESSITY.

339
00:16:25,585 --> 00:16:27,220
WHEN McCARTIN'S ABOUT.

340
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:29,121
HE SAID THERE'S NO TIME
FOR TALKIN' WITH STRANGERS,

341
00:16:29,121 --> 00:16:31,123
AND McCARTIN DOES ALL
THE TALKING ON THE ISLAND.

342
00:16:31,123 --> 00:16:33,659
WELL, HE SAID, "BLOW IT OUT
YOUR--" SOMETHING, I'M NOT SURE.

343
00:16:36,662 --> 00:16:39,298
JOE STRUMMER GOES FISHING.

344
00:16:39,298 --> 00:16:42,935
- [FOREIGN WORD]
- YOU HAVE A GREAT TIDE
TO YOUR NECESSITY.

345
00:16:42,935 --> 00:16:44,804
TWO OF THE DIVERS
DIDN'T COME UP, JOE.

346
00:16:44,804 --> 00:16:47,306
- THEY THINK THEY'RE GONE.
- GONE?

347
00:16:47,306 --> 00:16:49,242
[CROW] YES, A WORD MEANING,
"NOT HERE ANYMORE."

348
00:16:52,678 --> 00:16:55,014
[SERVO] STOP SHAKING THE BOAT.
I'M GONNA PUKE.

349
00:16:56,983 --> 00:16:59,752
[IMITATES FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

350
00:16:59,752 --> 00:17:01,220
THERE'S ONE!

351
00:17:02,488 --> 00:17:04,690
COLIN'S HERE.
[FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

352
00:17:04,690 --> 00:17:07,159
HE'S GOT TWO TIME-RELEASE
CAPLETS ON HIS BACK.

353
00:17:07,159 --> 00:17:09,862
- WELL, NOW HE'S ONLY GOT ONE!
- HEY!

354
00:17:09,862 --> 00:17:12,798
AYE.

355
00:17:12,798 --> 00:17:17,036
"OVERCOME BY AN EXCESS OF
POTATOES, GUINNESS AND GUILT."

356
00:17:17,036 --> 00:17:19,972
- [COUGHING]
- OKAY, LET'S TAKE A LOOK
OF THAT BUTT.

357
00:17:25,745 --> 00:17:27,013
SO THAT'S WHAT'S
WORRYING McCARTIN.

358
00:17:28,681 --> 00:17:30,816
I SHOULD VISIT TENNILLE
WHEN I'M ASHORE.

359
00:17:32,818 --> 00:17:35,021
THE MACKEREL'S IN THE-- UGH.

360
00:17:38,024 --> 00:17:40,493
- HE'S DEAD.
- DEAD? HOW?

361
00:17:40,493 --> 00:17:43,062
- HOW DEAD? WELL, JUST DEAD!
- YOU SAW HIM COME UP.

362
00:17:44,797 --> 00:17:47,033
IF YOU ASK ME,
HE DIED OF FRIGHT.

363
00:17:47,033 --> 00:17:49,602
COULDN'T BE THE BOILED BACK FAT
HE ATE EVERY DAY OF HIS LIFE!

364
00:17:53,439 --> 00:17:56,542
I THINK THAT'S OUR SHIP, IT'S
JUST THEY ALL LOOK THE SAME.

365
00:17:58,344 --> 00:18:00,513
- THIS IS CRAZY--
- US, MARRYING.

366
00:18:00,513 --> 00:18:03,616
THERE WAS A MAN LOST DOWN THERE
TODAY, NOT EVEN A TRACE.

367
00:18:03,616 --> 00:18:06,886
ANOTHER ONE SAW SOMETHING
THAT SCARED HIM TO DEATH.

368
00:18:06,886 --> 00:18:09,789
LOOK, SAM. YOU DON'T
WANT TO GO, DON'T GO.

369
00:18:09,789 --> 00:18:13,526
I'M GOING ALL RIGHT. JUST TO
MAKE SURE THAT YOU GET BACK.

370
00:18:13,526 --> 00:18:17,363
- OOH, I GOT BACK.
- SURE. WITH A HATFUL OF GOLD.

371
00:18:17,363 --> 00:18:20,433
- HA? YOU GET IT?
- GET SET.

372
00:18:21,667 --> 00:18:23,769
- YEAH, OKAY.
- HOW DO THESE THINGS WORK?

373
00:18:28,307 --> 00:18:30,242
WELL, THIS ONE
SMELLS LIKE YOURS.

374
00:18:35,414 --> 00:18:37,984
- A BOAT MADE OF
FOOT-LONG HOT DOGS.
- [GIGGLES]

375
00:18:40,186 --> 00:18:42,722
NOW, I'M JUST GONNA HANG IT OUT
OVER THE SIDE HERE. DON'T LOOK.

376
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:51,430
- "THUNDERBORE!"
- "VOYAGE TO THE BOTTOM
OF THE YAWN!"

377
00:18:51,430 --> 00:18:55,001
- "THE ABYS-MAL."
- "DRIVING MISS DUMMY."

378
00:18:55,001 --> 00:18:57,269
[MIKE] WAIT. TH-THAT REALLY
DOESN'T WORK AT ALL.

379
00:18:57,269 --> 00:19:00,473
- REALLY?
- NO. REALLY FAILS
ON A WHOLE LOT OF LEVELS.

380
00:19:00,473 --> 00:19:04,610
- WELL, I TRY, MIKE, RIGHT?
- [WHISPERS] SORRY.

381
00:19:04,610 --> 00:19:07,680
WATCH FOR SHARKS.
I ACCIDENTALLY BATHED
IN FISH BLOOD THIS MORNING.

382
00:19:16,522 --> 00:19:18,824
DID YOU SAY
"BL-UB, BL-BL-BLUB"?

383
00:19:23,629 --> 00:19:26,832
WELL, ALL THIS HARD WATER.
IRELAND NEEDS THE CULLIGAN MAN.

384
00:19:28,934 --> 00:19:31,037
COUNTING PLANKTON
IS REALLY HARD.

385
00:19:36,709 --> 00:19:39,645
OOH. SOMEBODY SUNK A MACY'S
THANKSGIVING DAY PARADE BALLOON.

386
00:19:42,682 --> 00:19:44,850
COME ON, LET'S GET SOME
STALE BREAD AND FEED IT.

387
00:19:46,652 --> 00:19:48,521
YOU KNOW WHAT'S
GREAT THOUGH, SAM?

388
00:19:48,521 --> 00:19:51,590
I'M WETTING MY PANTS ENTIRE,
BUT IT REALLY DOESN'T MATTER
DOWN HERE.

389
00:19:55,361 --> 00:19:58,998
- WHAT DID YOU SEE, SAM?
- YOU BORROWED
MY OLD DISH TOWEL?

390
00:19:58,998 --> 00:20:01,033
I DON'T KNOW.

391
00:20:01,033 --> 00:20:03,369
BUT WHATEVER IT WAS, I NEVER
WANT TO SEE IT AGAIN.

392
00:20:03,369 --> 00:20:06,272
OH, LIKE YOU'RE THIS BIG PRIZE.
[CHUCKLES]

393
00:20:10,009 --> 00:20:13,779
[IRISH ACCENT]
♪ SHOW ME THE WAY TO GO HOME ♪

394
00:20:13,779 --> 00:20:15,448
♪ TIRED AND I WA... ♪

395
00:20:15,448 --> 00:20:17,149
THERE'S A DEAD HOBBIT
IN THAT TUBE.

396
00:20:20,086 --> 00:20:22,088
HOW GOES IT, SAM?

397
00:20:22,088 --> 00:20:24,156
THESE ARE THE LAST FEW BARRELS
COMING ON BOARD NOW.

398
00:20:24,156 --> 00:20:27,026
WELL, CLEAR THE STAGE FOR
A CAMPY MUSICAL REVIEW.

399
00:20:28,194 --> 00:20:30,362
OH, KEEP BACK.

400
00:20:30,362 --> 00:20:33,032
- CAPTAIN WANTS TO SEE YA.
- THOUGHT HIS NAME
WAS McBOX.

401
00:20:33,032 --> 00:20:36,202
- A FINE RAGE HE'S IN.
- OH, IT IS, IS IT?

402
00:20:36,202 --> 00:20:37,736
[IMITATING A CHIMP]

403
00:20:38,938 --> 00:20:40,973
LOOK, KID. GET DOWN
OFF THERE, WILL YA?

404
00:20:40,973 --> 00:20:43,442
- ABOUT THE PERMIT.
- WHAT ABOUT THE PERMIT?

405
00:20:43,442 --> 00:20:45,277
IT'S A HEATHEN LIE.

406
00:20:45,277 --> 00:20:48,280
MAYBE WE'D BETTER SEE
WHAT THIS JOKER'S GOT
IN MIND. WHERE IS HE?

407
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:51,083
- COME ON, THEN.
- ALL RIGHT.

408
00:20:51,083 --> 00:20:53,619
WELL, HERE'S THE SCRIPT.
YOU TAKE MY PART IN THE MOVIE
FOR A WHILE.

409
00:20:57,923 --> 00:21:01,060
THEIR POLYNESIAN TORCH CEREMONY
ISN'T TOO SUCCESSFUL THIS YEAR.

410
00:21:02,895 --> 00:21:05,798
- WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
- THEY THINK A SHARK GOT
THE MAN WHO WAS LOST.

411
00:21:10,803 --> 00:21:14,273
♪ BALI HAI WILL CALL YOU ♪

412
00:21:19,245 --> 00:21:21,580
MR. McCARTIN, I HEAR
YOU'VE GOT A BEEF.

413
00:21:21,580 --> 00:21:23,616
YOU WERE SNOOPIN' AROUND
OUT THERE.

414
00:21:23,616 --> 00:21:25,417
MY DIVER WAS TELLIN' ME.

415
00:21:25,417 --> 00:21:28,621
YEAH, AND I SUPPOSE
THEY TOLD YOU TO GIVE US
ALL THAT JAZZ ABOUT A PERMIT.

416
00:21:28,621 --> 00:21:30,456
ARE YOU DOUBTIN' MY WORD?

417
00:21:30,456 --> 00:21:32,324
YOU'RE RIGHT, MR. McCARTIN,
I AM.

418
00:21:32,324 --> 00:21:34,727
LOOK, I'M TRYING TO WRITE
 KRAPP'S LAST TAPE.

419
00:21:37,530 --> 00:21:40,499
MAY YOUR CORNED BEEF
NOT PICKLE CORRECTLY.

420
00:21:40,499 --> 00:21:43,035
AFTER YOU'VE LOADED WATER,
YOU LEAVE.

421
00:21:43,035 --> 00:21:45,738
- TONIGHT.
- THE SOONER, THE BETTER.

422
00:21:45,738 --> 00:21:48,073
THE TIGHTER THE SWEATER,
THE BOYS DEPEND ON US.

423
00:21:48,073 --> 00:21:52,545
SAY, THERE'S LIKE ONE COD
LEFT IN THE NORTH ATLANTIC,

424
00:21:52,545 --> 00:21:54,880
BUT DAMN IT, THEY'RE
GONNA GET IT!

425
00:21:56,282 --> 00:21:57,249
[GUFFAWING]

426
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:02,121
[SPEAKING GAELIC]

427
00:22:02,121 --> 00:22:03,956
THAT WAS JUST GRANDMA
TAKIN' A SWIM-- DON'T!

428
00:22:10,496 --> 00:22:12,731
- OH. OW!
- [LAUGHING]

429
00:22:13,799 --> 00:22:15,734
- WOW.
- [TRUMPETING]

430
00:22:15,734 --> 00:22:17,870
PATTY-CAKE, PATTY-CAKE...

431
00:22:19,438 --> 00:22:21,173
GO CHECK THAT OUT, KID.

432
00:22:22,641 --> 00:22:25,110
- [ROARING]
- DORKIN!

433
00:22:25,110 --> 00:22:27,179
HOW ARE YA?

434
00:22:29,281 --> 00:22:31,917
IT'S THE RARE ISOSCELES-EARED
UNDERWATER DRAGON!

435
00:22:34,086 --> 00:22:37,189
REALLY, GENTLEMEN,
MUST WE DO THIS EVERY NIGHT?

436
00:22:39,158 --> 00:22:41,193
OH, POOR ROBERT SHAW.
EATEN AGAIN.

437
00:22:46,131 --> 00:22:48,500
♪ TO REACH ♪

438
00:23:04,617 --> 00:23:07,519
OH, HELLO. I'M DIANA RIGG.

439
00:23:07,519 --> 00:23:09,855
INSPIRED BY THE GUY
IN TODAY'S MOVIE,

440
00:23:09,855 --> 00:23:12,424
WHO LOOKS KIND OF LIKE
SAMUEL BECKETT,

441
00:23:12,424 --> 00:23:15,861
WE PRESENT TO YOU A TRAGIC
COMEDY, IN ONE ACT.

442
00:23:15,861 --> 00:23:18,130
 WAITING FOR GORGO.

443
00:23:18,130 --> 00:23:19,765
THANK YOU, WON'T WE?

444
00:23:28,073 --> 00:23:30,542
NOTHING TO BE DONE.

445
00:23:30,542 --> 00:23:33,178
I'M BEGINNING TO COME 'ROUND
TO THAT OPINION.

446
00:23:35,381 --> 00:23:37,983
- LET'S GO.
- WE CAN'T.

447
00:23:37,983 --> 00:23:41,887
- WHY NOT?
- WE'RE... WAITING FOR GORGO.

448
00:23:41,887 --> 00:23:44,323
- AH, YEAH.
- ROWR-AH-ROWR!

449
00:23:44,323 --> 00:23:47,993
AH! AND THERE HE IS!
OH-HO, STOP!

450
00:23:47,993 --> 00:23:50,129
AAH! NO! NO! NO!

451
00:23:50,129 --> 00:23:51,930
- [ROARING]
- MOTHER! OW...

452
00:23:51,930 --> 00:23:54,133
- [CRASHING]
- [ROARS]

453
00:23:56,935 --> 00:23:58,971
[CLAPPING]

454
00:23:58,971 --> 00:24:00,906
[CHEERING]

455
00:24:05,344 --> 00:24:07,279
AH, THANK YOU.

456
00:24:08,814 --> 00:24:11,016
[LAUGHING]

457
00:24:11,016 --> 00:24:13,152
[CHEERING CONTINUES]

458
00:24:17,122 --> 00:24:19,692
[LOUDER CHEERING]

459
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:30,402
[RHYTHMIC CLAPPING]

460
00:24:45,918 --> 00:24:48,420
NO MORE, PLEASE.
[CHUCKLING]

461
00:24:48,420 --> 00:24:50,222
OH, MY.

462
00:24:54,326 --> 00:24:56,261
WE'LL BE BACK
AFTER THIS MESSAGE

463
00:24:56,261 --> 00:24:58,330
FROM WHISKEY AND CIGARETTES.

464
00:25:07,639 --> 00:25:10,642
- AH, NICE ONE.
- MUST BE CIGARETTES.

465
00:25:10,642 --> 00:25:12,578
LOOK AT THIS. THE POOR IRISH,
YOU KNOW?

466
00:25:12,578 --> 00:25:14,179
IF THEY'RE NOT
INVADED BY CROMWELL,

467
00:25:14,179 --> 00:25:16,849
OR INFESTED WITH LEPRECHAUNS,
THEY GOT THIS GUY!

468
00:25:20,285 --> 00:25:21,820
[IMITATING BOY]
I'VE GOT ME SLINGSHOT.

469
00:25:21,820 --> 00:25:23,122
SHOOT!

470
00:25:24,390 --> 00:25:25,691
NO, NO!

471
00:25:25,691 --> 00:25:28,260
♪ SHUFFLE OFF TO BUFF-A-LO ♪

472
00:25:30,429 --> 00:25:33,499
- [GROWLING]
- McROAR! O'GROWL!

473
00:25:35,768 --> 00:25:38,737
SORRY, I'M A LITTLE-- CAN YOU
TELL ME HOW TO GET TO TOKYO?

474
00:25:42,808 --> 00:25:44,176
QUICK, LET'S EMIGRATE.

475
00:25:50,115 --> 00:25:51,650
- NO. NO!
- LET GO!

476
00:25:51,650 --> 00:25:53,419
GUY'S GOOD AT
PUSHING KIDS AROUND.

477
00:26:00,159 --> 00:26:01,994
MM, HABANERO SAUCE.

478
00:26:04,296 --> 00:26:06,131
NOT A VERY GOOD JUGGLING ACT.

479
00:26:08,333 --> 00:26:11,904
AH, REAL SHAME FOR THE ISLAND.
THE LET'S GO EUROPE PEOPLE
ARE VISITING TONIGHT.

480
00:26:11,904 --> 00:26:13,605
AW.

481
00:26:15,007 --> 00:26:17,443
WALKING CATFISH
ARE REALLY BIG. WHOO!

482
00:26:21,280 --> 00:26:23,215
- DAVE FOLEY.
- [LAUGHS]

483
00:26:25,551 --> 00:26:27,352
HEY, COME ON! I WAS JUST
GOING COMIN' TO THE CEILIDH.

484
00:26:27,352 --> 00:26:28,954
I GUESS
YOU DON'T WANT ME, THEN.

485
00:26:35,794 --> 00:26:38,397
I'LL PUT ON MY ASBESTOS
UNDERWEAR, AND I'LL BE BACK.

486
00:26:40,532 --> 00:26:42,634
FINE. I'LL SPEND
MY EUROS ELSEWHERE!

487
00:26:44,570 --> 00:26:46,939
I NEVER--
[GURGLING]

488
00:26:51,743 --> 00:26:53,846
OPEN THE PUB! COME ON,
IT'S 9:00 AM!

489
00:26:57,749 --> 00:26:59,751
WE ALL HATED ENDGAME.

490
00:26:59,751 --> 00:27:02,454
WELL, THERE'S A MAN LOOKS
LIKE HE'S GOT A REAL PROBLEM.

491
00:27:02,454 --> 00:27:04,790
UH-HUH. I'LL BET HE'D PAY
THROUGH THE NOSE

492
00:27:04,790 --> 00:27:06,558
IF WE COULD SOLVE IT FOR HIM.

493
00:27:06,558 --> 00:27:09,061
HE SAID, "WE'RE ALL OUT
OF LUCKY CHARMS."

494
00:27:11,797 --> 00:27:13,432
HEY. HEY, MISTER.

495
00:27:13,432 --> 00:27:15,200
WE'LL BE WANTING A PASSAGE
ON YOUR SHIP,

496
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:18,370
JUST AS SOON AS HE GETS AROUND
TO GIVING US OUR PAY.

497
00:27:18,370 --> 00:27:21,840
NOW, HOLD ON. YOU'LL GET
YOUR PAY IF YOU LIKE.

498
00:27:21,840 --> 00:27:23,775
THERE'LL BE NO TAKING
OF PASSAGE ON ANY SHIP.

499
00:27:23,775 --> 00:27:25,844
- WHY NOT?
- YEAH, WHY NOT?

500
00:27:25,844 --> 00:27:28,380
I THINK THEY'RE MUMBLING
A VERY GOOD POINT THERE.

501
00:27:28,380 --> 00:27:30,983
OH, FOR GOD'S SAKE, LET'S
GO INSIDE AND TALK ABOUT IT.

502
00:27:30,983 --> 00:27:32,284
SURE.

503
00:27:32,284 --> 00:27:34,219
YOU COULD BE A PROBLEM,
BROTHER, COULDN'T YOU?

504
00:27:36,054 --> 00:27:38,257
IF THEY ALL LEAVE NOW,
MY PORT MEN, MY DIVERS,

505
00:27:38,257 --> 00:27:40,092
THE LOT OF THEM, THE WHOLE
THING WILL GO TO SMASH.

506
00:27:40,092 --> 00:27:41,760
- SMASH?
- ME, I KIND OF SEE THEIR POINT.

507
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:44,096
GOT ANY OTHER REASON
FOR NOT WANTING THEM TO LEAVE?

508
00:27:44,096 --> 00:27:45,430
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

509
00:27:45,430 --> 00:27:48,467
WELL, LIKE,
MAYBE THEY'D TALK TOO MUCH.

510
00:27:48,467 --> 00:27:50,202
ABOUT THESE LAUNDRY TOKENS.

511
00:27:50,202 --> 00:27:52,704
- WHERE DID YOU GET THOSE?
- SAME PLACE AS YOU.

512
00:27:52,704 --> 00:27:55,173
SUPPOSING WE GOT RID
OF THAT THING FOR YOU.

513
00:27:55,173 --> 00:27:57,643
- THE BEAST?
- THAT'S RIGHT, IAN PAISLEY.

514
00:27:57,643 --> 00:27:59,912
- DO YOU THINK YOU CAN?
- MAYBE.

515
00:27:59,912 --> 00:28:02,481
IF YOU GIVE ME ONE OF
YOUR NON-SEXUAL MASSAGES.

516
00:28:02,481 --> 00:28:04,816
LET'S TAKE ANOTHER LOOK
IN THERE FIRST, HUH?

517
00:28:04,816 --> 00:28:07,019
YOU WANT TO PLAY WITH
YOUR HOT WHEELS AGAIN.

518
00:28:13,992 --> 00:28:17,930
SORRY ABOUT HOW THIS LOOKS,
THE WALLS NEED TO BE RE-DUNGED.

519
00:28:17,930 --> 00:28:19,398
OPEN THE SAFE.

520
00:28:19,398 --> 00:28:22,868
MAN, I'M THE HARBOR MASTER.

521
00:28:22,868 --> 00:28:24,069
I DON'T HAVE TO LISTEN
TO YOU GUYS.

522
00:28:24,069 --> 00:28:25,971
I CAN GO AND MASTER THE HARBOR
ANYTIME I WANT.

523
00:28:27,039 --> 00:28:29,107
THIS IS SO BOGUS.

524
00:28:32,377 --> 00:28:34,313
YOU DONE ALL RIGHT
FOR YOURSELF.

525
00:28:35,647 --> 00:28:37,082
HOW ABOUT THIS
FOR A DOWN PAYMENT?

526
00:28:37,082 --> 00:28:39,017
DO YOU LIKE THIS ONE, SAM?

527
00:28:39,017 --> 00:28:41,086
YOU MUST BE OUT OF YOUR MIND. 
A THING LIKE THAT'S PRICELESS.

528
00:28:41,086 --> 00:28:42,721
IT BELONGED TO
HAGAR THE HORRIBLE.

529
00:28:42,721 --> 00:28:45,324
AND HOW DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE GOING TO DISPOSE OF IT?

530
00:28:45,324 --> 00:28:47,960
WELL, YOU MUST HAVE
FIGURED OUT A WAY.

531
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,795
I'LL BET WE CAN.

532
00:28:49,795 --> 00:28:51,330
- YOU DIRTY BLACKMAILER!
- SHUT UP! 

533
00:28:51,330 --> 00:28:53,398
YOU'RE GETTING OFF EASY, FRIEND.

534
00:28:53,398 --> 00:28:56,902
- I COULD HAVE GRABBED THE LOT.
- WHEN WILL YA START?

535
00:28:56,902 --> 00:29:01,640
- NOW. WHY NOT?
- HEH. TOTALLY TOASTED
YOUR IRISH SODA BREAD.

536
00:29:04,009 --> 00:29:06,311
[CLUCKING, LAUGHING]

537
00:29:08,213 --> 00:29:09,815
- MISTER RYAN!
- HOW'S YOUR HOPE?

538
00:29:09,815 --> 00:29:11,350
- MR. RYAN.
- AND YOUR DAUGHTER?

539
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:13,185
WHAT IS IT, KID?

540
00:29:13,185 --> 00:29:15,053
YOU'LL BE TRYING TO CATCH HIM. 
GORGO.

541
00:29:15,053 --> 00:29:17,022
YEAH, MAYBE.

542
00:29:17,022 --> 00:29:18,924
- NOT AFRAID, ARE YOU?
- NO.

543
00:29:18,924 --> 00:29:20,492
BUT IT'S A BAD THING
YOU'RE DOIN'.

544
00:29:20,492 --> 00:29:22,794
A TERRIBLE BAD THING,
MR. RYAN.

545
00:29:22,794 --> 00:29:25,564
- "TED-I-BULL."
- WHY DON'T YOU CALL ME JOE?

546
00:29:25,564 --> 00:29:29,635
- OKAY-- JOE.
- OKAY, SEAN.

547
00:29:31,203 --> 00:29:34,640
BUT YOU MISSED MY POINT! DESPITE
OUR NEW FAMILIARITY WITH NAMES.

548
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,508
WE MIGHT BE ABLE
TO CATCH HIM IN THE NETS.

549
00:29:36,508 --> 00:29:37,943
- WHO, THE KID?
- YEAH. 

550
00:29:37,943 --> 00:29:39,911
HOW DO YOU PROPOSE
TO KILL A THING LIKE THAT?

551
00:29:39,911 --> 00:29:42,347
OH, I DON'T KNOW.
DYNAMITE, MAYBE.

552
00:29:43,815 --> 00:29:46,885
EVER STOP TO THINK WHAT A THING
LIKE THAT MIGHT BE WORTH ALIVE?

553
00:29:46,885 --> 00:29:48,754
PROBABLY ABOUT
100 WELL-KNIT SWEATERS.

554
00:29:55,861 --> 00:29:58,397
BOUGHT IT FROM THE GOVERNMENT.
IT'S CALLED "FAT MAN"
OR SOMETHING.

555
00:30:02,234 --> 00:30:04,169
YOU REALLY THINK
YOU'LL CATCH HIM WITH THAT?

556
00:30:04,169 --> 00:30:06,204
SURE, WHY NOT?

557
00:30:06,204 --> 00:30:08,807
I THINK IT'LL BE A LIGHT
COLLECTOR-- A SORT OF LURE.

558
00:30:08,807 --> 00:30:10,842
IF THAT DOESN'T WORK,
WE'LL TRY SOMETHING ELSE.

559
00:30:10,842 --> 00:30:12,577
- OKAY, HARRY, COME ON.
- OKAY.

560
00:30:12,577 --> 00:30:14,780
"TRY SOMETHING ELSE."
BRILLIANT!

561
00:30:16,682 --> 00:30:18,250
JOHNNY! STOP!

562
00:30:18,250 --> 00:30:20,652
THERE'S A SKELETON OF
A LITTLE FRENCH GUY IN HERE.

563
00:30:23,822 --> 00:30:27,259
- WELL.
- READY WHEN YOU ARE, JOE.

564
00:30:27,259 --> 00:30:30,362
OKAY. TAKE HER UP!

565
00:30:30,362 --> 00:30:32,330
WAIT, WAIT.
WHAT ARE YOU DOING TO ME?

566
00:30:32,330 --> 00:30:33,432
TAKE HER OUT!

567
00:30:33,432 --> 00:30:36,768
OUT. LOWER AWAY!

568
00:30:38,103 --> 00:30:40,906
- DOWN!
- CAST HIM OVER
BY THOSE LILY PADS!

569
00:30:46,812 --> 00:30:48,947
BOY, I'D SURE HATE TO GO
UNDERWATER IN THIS THING.

570
00:30:48,947 --> 00:30:51,249
GUYS?

571
00:30:51,249 --> 00:30:54,019
IMMEDIATELY CROSS LINES
WITH THE GUY TRYING
TO CATCH GODZILLA.

572
00:30:58,056 --> 00:30:59,624
ROLL DOWN THE WINDOW
HERE-- D'OH!

573
00:31:01,159 --> 00:31:02,694
- SAM?
- CAN I COME UP NOW?

574
00:31:02,694 --> 00:31:04,696
- CAN YOU HEAR ME?
- YEAH, I CAN HEAR YOU.

575
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:07,532
- GIVE ME ABOUT 15 FATHOMS.
- DOWN!

576
00:31:07,532 --> 00:31:09,434
WILL YOU LET ME FINISH?

577
00:31:11,269 --> 00:31:14,206
YES, CIVIL WAR
SUBMARINE TECHNOLOGY.

578
00:31:16,341 --> 00:31:18,276
WHY DOES THAT OCTOPUS
HAVE A HACKSAW?

579
00:31:19,811 --> 00:31:21,079
[KNOCKING]

580
00:31:25,951 --> 00:31:28,320
- SAM?
- I MEAN IT.
I'M REALLY SCARED NOW!

581
00:31:28,320 --> 00:31:30,822
- TOM?
- TEN FATHOMS. HOW'S THAT?

582
00:31:30,822 --> 00:31:33,959
OKAY. THAT'LL DO.

583
00:31:33,959 --> 00:31:35,627
GIVE ME FOUR TO FIVE KNOTS.

584
00:31:35,627 --> 00:31:37,796
SLOW ENGINE.
HEADED DOWN THE BAY.

585
00:31:37,796 --> 00:31:39,264
SLOW ENGINES!

586
00:31:39,264 --> 00:31:42,000
SHARK. SHARK.

587
00:31:46,004 --> 00:31:48,306
- A LITTLE MOOD LIGHTING.
- [LAUGHS]

588
00:31:58,850 --> 00:32:01,052
IF THEY DON'T LET ME UP
TO GO SOON, IT WILL BE

589
00:32:01,052 --> 00:32:02,320
A YELLOW SUBMARINE.

590
00:32:08,426 --> 00:32:10,896
THEY'LL DRAG HIM INTO A ROCK,
BECAUSE THERE'S SO DELIGHTED

591
00:32:10,896 --> 00:32:12,330
WITH THE RED SKY.

592
00:32:14,566 --> 00:32:15,934
STEVEN SEAGAL.

593
00:32:18,470 --> 00:32:21,239
[MUTTERING, CHUCKLING]

594
00:32:21,239 --> 00:32:24,242
SAM, CAN YOU HEAR ME?
STOP ENGINES!

595
00:32:24,242 --> 00:32:25,610
STOP ENGINES!

596
00:32:25,610 --> 00:32:27,312
MM. CANNED GUY.

597
00:32:27,312 --> 00:32:29,948
STOP, SAM. NOT TOO FAST.
I DON'T WANT TO LOSE HIM.

598
00:32:29,948 --> 00:32:32,050
SLOW UP. UP, UP!

599
00:32:34,719 --> 00:32:36,188
WHAT YOUR LAUNDRY SEES.

600
00:32:42,460 --> 00:32:44,863
UH, DID WE DEVELOP
A STEP TWO YET?

601
00:32:44,863 --> 00:32:46,698
SAM! SAM, PULL UP!

602
00:32:46,698 --> 00:32:49,267
UP, QUICK, QUICK!
PULL UP! UP!

603
00:32:49,267 --> 00:32:51,203
GEE, YEOMAN PUSHY-PANTS.

604
00:32:53,371 --> 00:32:55,173
SAM! SAM! PULL UP!

605
00:32:55,173 --> 00:32:57,509
- PULL UP!
- ARR!

606
00:32:57,509 --> 00:33:00,512
- MM, YUMMY.
- SAM! SAM!

607
00:33:00,512 --> 00:33:03,481
- PULL UP!
- ARRGH!

608
00:33:03,481 --> 00:33:05,617
- SAM, QUICK! 
- ARR?

609
00:33:06,785 --> 00:33:08,353
SAM! PULL UP!

610
00:33:08,353 --> 00:33:10,755
IT WON'T TAKE ANYMORE.
SHE'LL SNAP THE CABLE.

611
00:33:10,755 --> 00:33:13,358
SO DROP YOUR NET!
DROP YOUR NET!

612
00:33:13,358 --> 00:33:14,759
DROP THE NET!

613
00:33:14,759 --> 00:33:17,128
- ALL HANDS ON NET!
- CARRY ON!

614
00:33:17,128 --> 00:33:19,798
- THIS ONE. TAKE IT UP.
- HEY, THERE'S NO POP-TOP.

615
00:33:19,798 --> 00:33:22,667
- AROUND HIS NECK!
- DROP IT!

616
00:33:22,667 --> 00:33:24,069
DROP IT!

617
00:33:24,069 --> 00:33:26,171
- [ROARING]
- NOW HE'S LAYING HIS EGGS.

618
00:33:26,171 --> 00:33:28,840
- HE MUST EXPECT ME
TO SWIM OVER THEM.
- BAH!

619
00:33:33,678 --> 00:33:36,715
SHOULD GORGO COOPERATE AND
JUST WRAP HIMSELF IN THE NET?

620
00:33:36,715 --> 00:33:39,017
- IT HAS HAPPENED.
- OW!

621
00:33:39,017 --> 00:33:41,186
DONE.

622
00:33:43,555 --> 00:33:45,891
- READY ON THE WINCH!
- LIGHT ON THE STARCH!

623
00:33:45,891 --> 00:33:47,926
EASY ON THE MAYONNAISE!

624
00:33:49,461 --> 00:33:51,596
THEY'RE GOING TO HAVE
A BIG GORGO BOIL IN A MOMENT.

625
00:33:54,132 --> 00:33:55,667
FREE THAT END!

626
00:33:57,102 --> 00:33:59,204
FIRE AWAY!

627
00:33:59,204 --> 00:34:00,739
TIGHTEN UP THOSE
GUY ROPES.

628
00:34:00,739 --> 00:34:02,841
BRIAN JUST FOUND
ONE OF HIS WHORES!

629
00:34:02,841 --> 00:34:04,542
[GORGO GASPING]

630
00:34:07,846 --> 00:34:11,249
"AM IN... IRELAND...
SEND... REAL... FOOD."

631
00:34:11,249 --> 00:34:13,885
- [CHUCKLES]
- "HELLO MR. AND MRS.
NORTHUMBRIA,

632
00:34:13,885 --> 00:34:15,453
AND ALL THE SHIPS AT SEA."

633
00:34:15,453 --> 00:34:16,988
THE HEADLINES OF
THE ENTIRE WORLD

634
00:34:16,988 --> 00:34:19,057
ARE BEING MONOPOLIZED
BY THE NEWS OF THE CAPTURE

635
00:34:19,057 --> 00:34:22,761
OF A FANTASTIC MONSTER,
SEEMINGLY OF PREHISTORIC ORIGIN,

636
00:34:22,761 --> 00:34:24,996
OFF THE COAST OF IRELAND.
- ♪♪ [HUMMING]

637
00:34:24,996 --> 00:34:27,365
PUZZLED SCIENTISTS
ARE ALREADY SPECULATING

638
00:34:27,365 --> 00:34:29,301
THAT THE MONSTER MAY HAVE BEEN
RELEASED FROM SOME

639
00:34:29,301 --> 00:34:32,570
VAST, SUB-OCEANIC CAVERN
FAR BENEATH THE EARTH'S CRUST.

640
00:34:32,570 --> 00:34:34,873
BY UNPRECEDENTED VOLCANIC
ERUPTION,

641
00:34:34,873 --> 00:34:36,975
WHICH OCCURRED IN THE AREA
LAST WEEK.

642
00:34:36,975 --> 00:34:39,210
SOME SCIENTIFIC AUTHORITIES
ARE SUGGESTING...

643
00:34:39,210 --> 00:34:42,113
THAT THE WHOLE THING IS MERELY
AN ELABORATE IRISH HOAX.

644
00:34:42,113 --> 00:34:44,215
NEVERTHELESS, THE IRISH
GOVERNMENT ARE SENDING

645
00:34:44,215 --> 00:34:46,017
TWO OF THEIR TOP
PALEONTOLOGISTS

646
00:34:46,017 --> 00:34:47,919
TO CLAIM THE CREATURE
FOR IRELAND.

647
00:34:47,919 --> 00:34:50,121
IF IT DOES EXIST.

648
00:34:50,121 --> 00:34:52,691
THEY SET UP THE PHONE
SO HE CAN TALK TO HIS FAMILY.

649
00:34:52,691 --> 00:34:54,459
HI, HONEY.
GOT CAPTURED AGAIN.

650
00:34:54,459 --> 00:34:56,995
THERE'S YOUR FRIEND, PROFESSOR.

651
00:34:56,995 --> 00:34:58,229
I'LL TELL MY PARTNER
YOU'RE HERE.

652
00:35:00,632 --> 00:35:02,567
RADIO, SKIPPER.

653
00:35:04,069 --> 00:35:06,638
"LONDON TURTLENECK COMPANY
HAS ISSUED A RECALL,

654
00:35:06,638 --> 00:35:08,940
A POTENTIALLY FATAL FLAW--
OH, GREAT!

655
00:35:08,940 --> 00:35:11,242
THE TWO PROFESSORS WITH DEVLIN
JUST COME ON BOARD.

656
00:35:11,242 --> 00:35:13,244
SHOW 'EM UP.

657
00:35:13,244 --> 00:35:15,547
"I GOTTA GO, HONEY.
NO, I'M FINE.

658
00:35:15,547 --> 00:35:17,816
I GOTTA GO.
THERE'S SOME GUYS. "

659
00:35:17,816 --> 00:35:21,353
I WONDER IF YOU REALIZE,
CAPTAIN RYAN, THE ENORMOUS
SCIENTIFIC VALUE...

660
00:35:21,353 --> 00:35:22,887
OF THIS DISCOVERY.

661
00:35:22,887 --> 00:35:25,657
- I THINK WE DO, PROFESSOR.
- WELL, THEN.

662
00:35:25,657 --> 00:35:27,892
- I SHALL WIRELESS
TO THE UNIVERSITY OF DUBLIN.
- WHY?

663
00:35:27,892 --> 00:35:29,694
THEY WANT US
TO MAKE PREPARATIONS
TO RECEIVE THE ANIMAL.

664
00:35:29,694 --> 00:35:32,163
- I SEE.
- YOU WILL PROCEED TO DUBLIN,

665
00:35:32,163 --> 00:35:35,634
- WHO JIFFED?
- YOU WOULD BE PROPERLY
COMPENSATED FOR YOUR SERVICES.

666
00:35:35,634 --> 00:35:37,902
OH, SURE, SURE.

667
00:35:37,902 --> 00:35:40,271
WELL, WE'LL-- WE'LL MEET THERE.

668
00:35:40,271 --> 00:35:42,774
UNLESS YOU WOULD LIKE
ONE OF US TO GO WITH YOU.

669
00:35:42,774 --> 00:35:44,476
OH, THAT WON'T BE
NECESSARY, PROFESSOR.

670
00:35:44,476 --> 00:35:46,645
I WON'T EAT MUCH.

671
00:35:46,645 --> 00:35:47,879
BUT THERE'S ONE THING.

672
00:35:47,879 --> 00:35:50,715
THE ANIMAL'S SKIN
SHOULD BE KEPT WET,

673
00:35:50,715 --> 00:35:52,717
WITH A CONTINUOUS
STREAM OF WATER.

674
00:35:52,717 --> 00:35:54,119
- I SEE.
- THIS IS MOST IMPORTANT.

675
00:35:54,119 --> 00:35:55,320
I'LL TAKE CARE OF IT.

676
00:35:55,320 --> 00:35:57,022
WHEN DO YOU INTEND
SAILING, CAPTAIN?

677
00:35:57,022 --> 00:35:58,523
TONIGHT, IF THAT'S
OKAY BY YOU.

678
00:35:58,523 --> 00:36:00,258
ALL THE BETTER.
SEE YOU IN DUBLIN.

679
00:36:00,258 --> 00:36:03,661
UNIVERSITY OF DUBLIN.
"PROPERLY COMPENSATED."

680
00:36:03,661 --> 00:36:06,364
- SENTENCE FRAGMENTS.
- BIG DEAL.

681
00:36:06,364 --> 00:36:09,334
- TAKE A LOOK AT THIS, SAM.
- TAKE A LOOK AT THIS, SAM!

682
00:36:09,334 --> 00:36:11,469
IT'S FROM DORKING CIRCUS
IN LONDON.

683
00:36:11,469 --> 00:36:14,672
- YEAH.
- THE OFFER $30,000 AGAINST
50% OF THE GROSS.

684
00:36:14,672 --> 00:36:16,608
50% OF MARY GROSS, I MEAN.

685
00:36:18,443 --> 00:36:21,413
- SET A COURSE FOR LONDON, SAM.
- I GOT A HANKERING
FOR ORGAN MEAT.

686
00:36:24,249 --> 00:36:26,618
FORGOT TO BRING IN THE STRING.
GORGO'S DRAGGING.

687
00:36:29,354 --> 00:36:31,289
SOON, GORGO'S SCAMPERING
ON THE DECK,

688
00:36:31,289 --> 00:36:33,258
MAKIN' FRIENDS
WITH ALL THE SAILORS.

689
00:36:36,828 --> 00:36:39,030
OH, GREAT.

690
00:36:40,098 --> 00:36:42,267
[SNORTS DISMISSIVELY]

691
00:36:42,267 --> 00:36:45,570
- [SHIP'S HORN BLOWING]
- WHOA! THAT WAS ME. SORRY.

692
00:36:46,638 --> 00:36:48,606
- [HORN BLOWS AGAIN]
- WHOOPS.

693
00:36:50,775 --> 00:36:54,312
♪ AH, MESS IT AROUND
LA DI, LA-DA-DA-DA ♪

694
00:36:56,648 --> 00:36:59,084
AH, KID, COULD YOU SALT
YOURSELF AND COME OVER HERE?

695
00:36:59,084 --> 00:37:01,553
I CAME TO LET YOU GO BACK
TO THE SEA.

696
00:37:01,553 --> 00:37:04,389
AND MAYBE LAY IN
SOME MARINADE.

697
00:37:06,124 --> 00:37:08,960
A HIP EMBARGO JUST NEEDS
SOME NEW POINTS AND PLUGS.

698
00:37:11,996 --> 00:37:14,933
AND GO PLAY ON GAMERA'S
BACK, KID. I'M NOT INTO IT.

699
00:37:20,772 --> 00:37:22,474
YOU LITTLE NUTHEAD!

700
00:37:22,474 --> 00:37:24,809
- WHAT DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE DOING?
- HEY.

701
00:37:24,809 --> 00:37:26,578
- TAKE IT EASY.
- HEY, HEY, HEY.

702
00:37:26,578 --> 00:37:28,279
I CAME TO LET HIM
GO BACK TO THE SEA,

703
00:37:28,279 --> 00:37:29,714
- WHERE HE BELONGS.
- WHY?

704
00:37:29,714 --> 00:37:32,450
MAYBE TO SAVE
YOUR SILLY SKIN FOR YOU.

705
00:37:32,450 --> 00:37:36,020
I HAVE A GOOD NOTION
TO TOSS YOU OVER THE SIDE.

706
00:37:36,020 --> 00:37:37,789
WOULDN'T BE SENDING
ME BACK, NOW.

707
00:37:38,857 --> 00:37:40,458
- HARRY!
- HERE!

708
00:37:40,458 --> 00:37:42,927
BETTER GET OUR LITTLE
STOWAWAY INTO A BUNK.

709
00:37:42,927 --> 00:37:44,529
AND WASH HIS FACE.

710
00:37:44,529 --> 00:37:46,664
HARRY, PUT A GUARD
ON THAT THING, 24 HOURS,

711
00:37:46,664 --> 00:37:47,832
- AND GIVE HIM A RIFLE.
- RIGHT NOW. 

712
00:37:47,832 --> 00:37:49,100
DON'T GIVE THE MONSTER A RIFLE.

713
00:37:49,100 --> 00:37:50,668
I COULD BE WATCHING HIM
FOR YOU, NO?

714
00:37:50,668 --> 00:37:52,804
YEAH, YOU. YOU'D BE GREAT,
WOULDN'T YOU?

715
00:37:54,506 --> 00:37:56,574
AND IF IT SO MUCH AS MOVES...

716
00:37:56,574 --> 00:37:59,644
START SHOOTIN' AND THEN,
RUN LIKE THE DEVIL.

717
00:37:59,644 --> 00:38:01,546
PICK UP MY TAIL AND
CLATTER ACROSS THE DECK

718
00:38:01,546 --> 00:38:03,548
IN MY CLOVEN HOOVES?

719
00:38:03,548 --> 00:38:05,850
- ALL RIGHT.
- HEY! SCREW!

720
00:38:05,850 --> 00:38:07,819
REACH IN MY POCKET,
GET ME A CIGARETTE.

721
00:38:10,021 --> 00:38:12,457
TELL US SOMETHING, KID.

722
00:38:12,457 --> 00:38:14,025
ANYONE EVER SEE
THAT THING BEFORE?

723
00:38:14,025 --> 00:38:16,161
BRENDAN BEHAN DID,
BUT HE WAS DRUNK.

724
00:38:16,161 --> 00:38:19,264
WHY SHOULD EVERYBODY HAVE TO
SEE IT? TO KNOW IT'S THERE?

725
00:38:19,264 --> 00:38:22,167
IS THIS KID SPEAKING
IN BAM-BAM LANGUAGE?

726
00:38:22,167 --> 00:38:24,469
GO BACK TO SLEEP, KID.

727
00:38:24,469 --> 00:38:26,471
♪♪ [HUMMING ALONG]

728
00:38:26,471 --> 00:38:29,107
WE'LL BE TURNING YOU OVER
TO INTERPOL. GOOD NIGHT.

729
00:38:32,177 --> 00:38:34,846
LET'S GO SWIPE
THE CAPTAIN'S STRAWBERRIES.
THAT'S ALWAYS FUNNY.

730
00:38:34,846 --> 00:38:36,981
[HORN BLOWS]

731
00:38:38,483 --> 00:38:41,486
♪ AVERAGE-SIZE BUBBLES
IN THE BRINE ♪

732
00:38:41,486 --> 00:38:45,757
- JUST PHOSPHORUS, SAM.
- BUT IT'S COMING
FROM THE SCUPPERS.

733
00:38:45,757 --> 00:38:48,493
IT'S THE WATER OFF THE ANIMAL.

734
00:38:48,493 --> 00:38:51,429
WELL, IT'S STILL SALT WATER.

735
00:38:51,429 --> 00:38:54,032
- YOU SEEING SPIRITS TOO?
- [SCREAMING]

736
00:38:54,032 --> 00:38:56,835
SOMEONE DIDN'T RINSE OUT
THE SINK AFTER HE SHAVED!

737
00:38:56,835 --> 00:38:59,170
HELP! HELP, QUICK!

738
00:39:01,639 --> 00:39:03,675
GORGO SEDUCED THE GUARD,
AND THEN TRIED TO KILL HIM.

739
00:39:03,675 --> 00:39:07,212
- [ROARING]
- COME ON!

740
00:39:07,212 --> 00:39:10,215
MY BRA'S HAVING
AN ANTI-SCURVY LINE, BUT FINE!

741
00:39:13,351 --> 00:39:17,155
- AH, NO, IT'S THE CUTE ONE.
- [WHISPERS] NO!

742
00:39:17,155 --> 00:39:19,090
[CHUCKLING]

743
00:39:19,090 --> 00:39:21,459
GET 'EM READY FOR BALE, SAM.

744
00:39:23,761 --> 00:39:25,930
KID, I TOLD YOU
TO STAY BELOW.

745
00:39:25,930 --> 00:39:28,066
OKAY, I'LL GO UP
AND STAY BELOW, THEN.

746
00:39:28,066 --> 00:39:30,201
[CHUCKLING]
HOTHEAD.

747
00:39:39,010 --> 00:39:41,079
- FILLED WITH BUTTER?
- GUYS, LOOK AT THIS!

748
00:39:41,079 --> 00:39:44,515
GUESS WHAT I GOT?
THE WILLIAM SYLVESTER VERSION
OF TRIVIAL PURSUIT.

749
00:39:44,515 --> 00:39:47,252
- WILLIAM SYLVESTER. HMM.
- YEAH.

750
00:39:47,252 --> 00:39:50,388
YEAH, I WAS GONNA GET
THE BABY BOOMER VERSION OF
THE WILLIAM SYLVESTER VERSION

751
00:39:50,388 --> 00:39:52,991
OF TRIVIAL PURSUIT, BUT I JUST
THOUGHT THE BASIC VERSION

752
00:39:52,991 --> 00:39:54,659
WOULD BE, YOU KNOW,
A LOT MORE FUN.

753
00:39:54,659 --> 00:39:56,828
- WHAT COLOR DO YOU WANT?
- UH, LET ME ANSWER THAT, MIKE,

754
00:39:56,828 --> 00:39:59,397
BY ASKING YOU, WHO THE HELL
IS WILLIAM SYLVESTER?

755
00:39:59,397 --> 00:40:01,933
[CHUCKLES]
COME ON, SERVO,
THE GUY IN TODAY'S MOVIE.

756
00:40:01,933 --> 00:40:06,371
HUH. I'M NOT RECALLING
ANY GUY IN TODAY'S MOVIE.

757
00:40:06,371 --> 00:40:08,539
AW, COME ON. HE WAS
THE MAIN GUY IN TODAY'S MOVIE.

758
00:40:08,539 --> 00:40:10,408
PLUS, HE WAS IN
 RIDING WITH DEATH, 

759
00:40:10,408 --> 00:40:13,144
AND DEVIL DOG, PLUS
 2001, A SPACE ODYSSEY.

760
00:40:13,144 --> 00:40:15,313
PLUS, A WHOLE BUNCH
OF OTHER--

761
00:40:15,313 --> 00:40:17,815
OH. OH, I SEE WHAT
YOU GUYS ARE DOING.

762
00:40:17,815 --> 00:40:20,585
I SEE. YOU'RE TRYING TO LEARN
ALL ABOUT WILLIAM SYLVESTER

763
00:40:20,585 --> 00:40:23,087
SO YOU CAN BEAT ME AT
THE WILLIAM SYLVESTER VERSION

764
00:40:23,087 --> 00:40:24,922
OF TRIVIAL PURSUIT--
BUT IT AIN'T GONNA HAPPEN!

765
00:40:24,922 --> 00:40:27,558
- YOU CAN GO FIRST,
THOUGH, CROW.
- I DON'T WANT TO.

766
00:40:27,558 --> 00:40:32,263
THERE YOU GO. OKAY.
YOU HAVE "HISTORY
OF WILLIAM SYLVESTER."

767
00:40:32,263 --> 00:40:33,831
[SIGHS, GROANS]

768
00:40:33,831 --> 00:40:36,034
OKAY... IN-- OH.

769
00:40:36,034 --> 00:40:38,670
OH, MAN. THIS IS SO EASY!

770
00:40:38,670 --> 00:40:43,608
IN 2001, A SPACE ODYSSEY, 
WHAT CHARACTER DID
WILLIAM SYLVESTER PLAY?

771
00:40:43,608 --> 00:40:45,476
I DON'T KNOW.

772
00:40:45,476 --> 00:40:47,979
WHAT DO YOU MEAN, YOU DO--
HEYWOOD FLOYD, HEYWOOD FLOYD.

773
00:40:47,979 --> 00:40:49,881
- EVERYBODY KNOWS THAT!
- YEAH. I NEEDED A FLOYD.

774
00:40:49,881 --> 00:40:51,616
OKAY, FINE.
YOUR TURN, SERVO.

775
00:40:51,616 --> 00:40:55,153
- OH, GOODIE.
- OKAY, HERE WE GO.

776
00:40:55,153 --> 00:40:57,922
OH, MAN! THIS-- I--
OH, THIS IS INCREDIBLE.

777
00:40:57,922 --> 00:41:01,859
"IN THE MOVIE GORGO, WHO
PLAYED THE CHARACTER OF SAM?"

778
00:41:01,859 --> 00:41:03,695
I DON'T KNOW.

779
00:41:03,695 --> 00:41:05,563
WHAT DO YOU MEAN, YOU D--
IT WAS WILLIAM SYLVESTER!

780
00:41:05,563 --> 00:41:07,799
IT WAS WILLIAM SYLVEST--
WE'RE WATCHING THE MOVIE TODAY.

781
00:41:07,799 --> 00:41:10,335
COME ON, YOU GUYS!
YOU'RE NOT EVEN TRYING.

782
00:41:10,335 --> 00:41:12,904
IT'S LIKE YOU'RE TRYING TO
SABOTAGE MY WILLIAM SYLVESTER

783
00:41:12,904 --> 00:41:14,639
VERSION OF TRIVIAL PURSUIT.

784
00:41:14,639 --> 00:41:17,575
- WE ARE, MIKE.
- WE PATENTLY DON'T CARE
ABOUT WILLIAM SYLVESTER.

785
00:41:17,575 --> 00:41:20,044
NOT A BIT.

786
00:41:20,044 --> 00:41:21,679
- SO YOU'RE CONCEDING.
- [CROW SIGHS]

787
00:41:21,679 --> 00:41:23,748
- [SERVO LAUGHS]
- YES, WE CONCEDE.

788
00:41:23,748 --> 00:41:27,485
YES! YES! YES! YES!
I KNOW MORE ABOUT WILLIAM
SYLVESTER THAN YOU DO.

789
00:41:27,485 --> 00:41:29,754
- OR YOU! YES! YES!
- SAD, REALLY.

790
00:41:29,754 --> 00:41:32,056
- [ALARM BUZZING]
- WHOO, WHOO, WHOO!
OH, MOVIE TIME!

791
00:41:46,070 --> 00:41:48,339
- DUDE, YOU ARE GAME.
- [MIKE CACKLES]

792
00:41:48,339 --> 00:41:50,007
WHEW.

793
00:41:50,007 --> 00:41:52,310
BUDDY HACKETT ON TRUMPET.
OH, YES.

794
00:41:54,479 --> 00:41:57,115
DOWN. DOWN.

795
00:41:57,115 --> 00:41:59,350
AND STAY CLEAR!

796
00:41:59,350 --> 00:42:01,419
- KEEP HER CLEAR!
- MEN NOT WITHOUT HATS.

797
00:42:01,419 --> 00:42:03,154
ALL RIGHT. LOWER IT A BIT.

798
00:42:06,090 --> 00:42:08,893
IT'S UNIQUE IN
EVOLUTIONARY BIOLOGY,

799
00:42:08,893 --> 00:42:11,062
AND YOU TURN IT
INTO A CIRCUS FREAK.

800
00:42:11,062 --> 00:42:13,731
OUTRAGEOUS. QUITE APART FROM
THE FACT THAT YOU STOLE IT.

801
00:42:13,731 --> 00:42:15,533
- DORKIN.
- THAT'S A MATTER OF OPINION.

802
00:42:15,533 --> 00:42:19,437
- WHAT'S THE ROW ABOUT?
- YOU KNOW ABSOLUTELY NOTHING
ABOUT THIS ANIMAL.

803
00:42:19,437 --> 00:42:22,407
- IT'S EXTREMELY DANGEROUS.
- WE'VE MANAGED TO HANDLE IT
ALL RIGHT SO FAR.

804
00:42:22,407 --> 00:42:25,176
- ONE GUY DIED, BUT--
- THEY MAY CARRY DISEASE
AND PARASITES.

805
00:42:25,176 --> 00:42:27,078
- OR UNKNOWN BACTERIA.
- LIKE ME!

806
00:42:27,078 --> 00:42:29,213
YOU BRING IT INTO THE HEART
OF A GREAT CITY...

807
00:42:29,213 --> 00:42:33,584
- LOOK. WHAT DO YOU WANT?
- FIRST, THE OPPORTUNITY
TO MAKE A COMPLETE STUDY.

808
00:42:33,584 --> 00:42:36,320
OKAY. IF IT DOESN'T
INTERFERE WITH BUSINESS.

809
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:38,122
BELIEVE ME, GENTLEMEN,
ONCE THE ANIMAL'S INSTALLED

810
00:42:38,122 --> 00:42:40,224
IN BATTERSEA PARK,
YOU'LL BE GIVEN EVERY FACILITY.

811
00:42:40,224 --> 00:42:41,993
HMM. I PRESUME
YOU'VE THOUGHT OF THE NEED

812
00:42:41,993 --> 00:42:43,995
OF GIVING THE ANIMAL
A TRANQUILIZING DRUG

813
00:42:43,995 --> 00:42:45,463
BEFORE YOU TRANSPORT IT?

814
00:42:45,463 --> 00:42:47,365
BECAUSE IF YOU HAVEN'T,
YOU'D BETTER.

815
00:42:47,365 --> 00:42:49,734
WELL, LAY THAT ON, THEN.

816
00:42:49,734 --> 00:42:51,135
GOOD DAY.

817
00:42:51,135 --> 00:42:52,904
WHICH ONE OF THESE GUYS
IS DORKIN? IT'S HARD TO TELL

818
00:42:52,904 --> 00:42:55,273
FROM THIS PICTURE.

819
00:42:57,742 --> 00:43:00,344
YES, "DORKIN"
MEANS GREAT ENTERTAINMENT!

820
00:43:00,344 --> 00:43:03,514
DORKIN UNDER THE BIG TOP!
COME SEE THE DELIGHTFUL
DORKIN MIDGETS,

821
00:43:03,514 --> 00:43:06,451
AND THE FUNNY DORKIN CLOWNS!

822
00:43:06,451 --> 00:43:08,820
 IN OUR MOST UNUSUAL TELECAST
 TO DATE,

823
00:43:08,820 --> 00:43:10,955
 WE BRING YOU THE ARRIVAL
 OF GORGO--

824
00:43:10,955 --> 00:43:15,426
THIS CREATURE, WHICH
SHOULD HAVE BEEN EXTINCT
TEN MILLION YEARS AGO, 

825
00:43:15,426 --> 00:43:18,596
 IS TRULY AN AWESOME SIGHT,
 AS IT IS TRANSPORTED THROUGH

826
00:43:18,596 --> 00:43:21,799
 THE STREETS OF MODERN LONDON
 ON ITS WAY TO BATTERSEA PARK.

827
00:43:21,799 --> 00:43:25,503
 OF COURSE, LONDONERS
 ARE NOTORIOUSLY SKEPTICAL,

828
00:43:25,503 --> 00:43:27,038
 AND A GOOD MANY
 WE'VE SPOKEN TO--

829
00:43:27,038 --> 00:43:29,307
[CROW, SERVO]
YES, QUITE SKEPTICAL...

830
00:43:29,307 --> 00:43:32,109
 ...AS A CIRCUS STUNT--
 BUT THIS ANIMAL IS REAL.

831
00:43:32,109 --> 00:43:34,111
 TAKE MY WORD FOR IT!

832
00:43:34,111 --> 00:43:36,881
- I'M DENNIS THATCHER.
- THE POLICE HAVE CLEARED
 ALL UNAUTHORIZED TRAFFIC

833
00:43:36,881 --> 00:43:39,317
 ALONG THE ROUTE,
 AS A PRECAUTIONARY MEASURE,

834
00:43:39,317 --> 00:43:41,752
 ALTHOUGH WE'RE ASSURED
 THERE'S NO DANGER,

835
00:43:41,752 --> 00:43:45,256
 THE CREATURE HAS BEEN GIVEN
 MASSIVE DOSES OF TRANQUILIZER.

836
00:43:45,256 --> 00:43:47,358
 MUCH CLOSER TO THIS THING,
 AND I COULD DO WITH

837
00:43:47,358 --> 00:43:49,660
 A BIT OF TRANQUILIZER MYSELF.

838
00:43:49,660 --> 00:43:51,662
 - ACTUALLY, IT'S NOT JOKE.
 - [CROW] I NEED DRUGS!

839
00:43:51,662 --> 00:43:55,500
 THERE ARE RUMORS
 THAT THE ANIMAL HAS KILLED 
 A NUMBER OF PERSONS ALREADY,

840
00:43:55,500 --> 00:43:56,934
 IN THE PROCESS OF HIS CAPTURE.

841
00:43:56,934 --> 00:44:00,404
BUT THEY WERE ALL IRISH,
SO IT'S OKAY!

842
00:44:00,404 --> 00:44:02,607
 NOW YOU SEE THE CIRCUS CROWDS
 AT BATTERSEA PARK,

843
00:44:02,607 --> 00:44:05,910
 IN THE FESTIVAL GARDENS
 WHERE GORGO, AS HE IS CALLED--

844
00:44:05,910 --> 00:44:09,080
 WE DON'T KNOW WHY-- WILL BE
 EXHIBITED TO THE PUBLIC.

845
00:44:09,080 --> 00:44:12,283
- AND HITLER PULLS UP. 
 - HERE WE CAN SEE
 THE INTREPID CAPTAIN RYAN,

846
00:44:12,283 --> 00:44:14,485
 THE ONE WITH THE CAP,
 GETTING OUT OF THE CAR

847
00:44:14,485 --> 00:44:16,354
 WITH HIS PARTNER, MR. SLADE.

848
00:44:16,354 --> 00:44:19,056
- IT SNOWED? 
 - THEY ARE THE MEN
 WHO CAPTURED THE ANIMAL.

849
00:44:19,056 --> 00:44:21,325
 AND I DON'T ENVY THEM THE JOB.

850
00:44:21,325 --> 00:44:23,961
 BUT OUR OWN MR. DORKIN,
 OF DORKIN CIRCUS,

851
00:44:23,961 --> 00:44:25,763
 - IN THE CHECKERED SUIT-- 
- IN THE CHICKEN SUIT?

852
00:44:25,763 --> 00:44:28,733
 BY THE WAY, WE'LL BE
INTERVIEWING MR. DORKIN SHORTLY

853
00:44:28,733 --> 00:44:31,435
 AT BATTERSEA PARK,
 SO STAY WITH US.

854
00:44:31,435 --> 00:44:32,937
OF COURSE, LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,

855
00:44:32,937 --> 00:44:35,506
I REALIZED AT ONCE THAT
THIS WAS THE MOST SHOCKING

856
00:44:35,506 --> 00:44:37,675
SCIENTIFIC DISCOVERY
OF THE 2Oth CENTURY,

857
00:44:37,675 --> 00:44:39,577
AND SO I CONTRACTED FOR
THE EXHIBITION OF THE ANIMAL,

858
00:44:39,577 --> 00:44:42,280
WE'VE BUILT A SPECIAL ENCLOSURE,
YOU WILL SEE IT LATER ON.

859
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:44,715
WE RUSHED THE JOB THROUGH
JUST SO EVERYONE IN LONDON

860
00:44:44,715 --> 00:44:46,884
WOULD HAVE AN OPPORTUNITY
OF SEEING GORGO THEMSELVES.

861
00:44:46,884 --> 00:44:48,886
- QUESTION?
- I HAVE A REPORT FROM DUBLIN

862
00:44:48,886 --> 00:44:51,055
THAT THE IRISH GOVERNMENT ARE
GOING TO TAKE LEGAL PROCEEDINGS

863
00:44:51,055 --> 00:44:53,791
- TO RECOVER THE ANIMAL.
- YES, I BELIEVE THAT
TO BE TRUE.

864
00:44:53,791 --> 00:44:56,394
OF COURSE, THE MATTER WILL
HAVE TO GO THROUGH THE COURTS
IN THE USUAL WAY.

865
00:44:56,394 --> 00:44:58,963
AND, SINCE I HAVE NO WAY OF
KNOWING HOW QUICKLY THEY'LL
RELEASE THEIR DECISION,

866
00:44:58,963 --> 00:45:02,333
I SUGGEST THAN ANYONE WHO
WANTS TO SEE GORGO DOES SO
SOON, AT BATTERSEA PARK.

867
00:45:02,333 --> 00:45:05,102
THAT NAME GORGO-- DOES IT
HAVE ANY SPECIAL SIGNIFICANCE?

868
00:45:05,102 --> 00:45:07,605
OH, CRIKEY, OF COURSE!
THE MONSTER OF GREEK MYTHOLOGY!

869
00:45:07,605 --> 00:45:10,007
THE GORGON! A CREATURE
SO TERRIFYING THAT
THE MERE SIGHT OF IT

870
00:45:10,007 --> 00:45:12,176
WOULD TURN A MAN TO STONE,
EXCUSE ME.

871
00:45:12,176 --> 00:45:15,613
- THIS IS FOR DORKIN.
- HOW MUCH MONEY DO YOU
EXPECT TO MAKE OUT OF IT?

872
00:45:15,613 --> 00:45:16,981
I'LL ANSWER THAT QUESTION
LATER ON.

873
00:45:16,981 --> 00:45:19,016
DON'T BOTHER THE MAN,
HE'S "DORKIN'".

874
00:45:19,016 --> 00:45:20,918
[CHUCKLING]

875
00:45:20,918 --> 00:45:23,254
I'M GONNA HAVE TO CLEAN UP
AFTER MIGHTY JOE YOUNG FIRST.

876
00:45:25,189 --> 00:45:26,624
LOWER AWAY.

877
00:45:26,624 --> 00:45:28,459
LOWER AWAY!

878
00:45:29,627 --> 00:45:31,162
EASY--

879
00:45:31,162 --> 00:45:33,297
- OKAY, SAM.
- EASY DOES IT!

880
00:45:33,297 --> 00:45:35,833
ONE DAY AT A TIME!
BE IN THE MOMENT!

881
00:45:35,833 --> 00:45:37,735
DON'T SWEAT THE SMALL STUFF.

882
00:45:40,705 --> 00:45:44,241
THE NET'S STICKING INTO
MY GROIN. IF YOU COULD JUST--

883
00:45:44,241 --> 00:45:46,344
- LOWER!
- FOR ANDREW!

884
00:45:46,344 --> 00:45:50,314
- LOWER!
- TRANQUILIZER SEEMS
TO BE WORKING.

885
00:45:50,314 --> 00:45:51,349
[IMITATING SCIENTIST]
I'M VERY MELLOW.

886
00:45:51,349 --> 00:45:53,117
SO FAR.

887
00:45:53,117 --> 00:45:55,653
OH. HERE.

888
00:45:55,653 --> 00:45:57,955
IS THERE A UNION
FOR MONSTER WRANGLERS HERE?

889
00:46:00,191 --> 00:46:01,692
WANT TO HELP, JOE?

890
00:46:01,692 --> 00:46:04,662
THEY'RE TRYING TO EXHUME
WILLIAM HOWARD TAFT.

891
00:46:06,998 --> 00:46:10,267
[ENGINE LABORING]

892
00:46:10,267 --> 00:46:12,737
- WIRE-CUTTERS.
- WIRE-CUTTERS, QUICK.

893
00:46:12,737 --> 00:46:14,472
OKAY.

894
00:46:15,973 --> 00:46:17,908
CUT THEM AT BOTH ENDS.

895
00:46:17,908 --> 00:46:20,678
WELL, HE HAS A SPLINTER.
LET'S TAKE CARE OF THAT FIRST.

896
00:46:24,815 --> 00:46:26,384
MM.
WORLD'S BIGGEST PORCHETTA.

897
00:46:31,889 --> 00:46:33,891
LOOK, WE ALL KNOW WHERE THIS
IS HEADING. CAN WE JUST

898
00:46:33,891 --> 00:46:36,093
START TOSSING BRITS AROUND?

899
00:46:38,229 --> 00:46:40,998
MISTER GORGO, IS IT
TRUE YOU HAD AN AFFAIR
WITH JUDITH EXNER?

900
00:46:42,533 --> 00:46:44,301
THAT'S A HELL OF
A DUMB THING TO DO!

901
00:46:44,301 --> 00:46:47,038
[GROWLING]

902
00:46:48,539 --> 00:46:50,641
I'M UP, I'M UP.

903
00:46:53,778 --> 00:46:55,946
HEY, I'VE GOT NET HAIR.

904
00:46:55,946 --> 00:46:59,617
- [ROARING]
- ♪ I CRUSH YOU,
YOU GET CRUSHED ♪

905
00:47:02,853 --> 00:47:07,091
THIS IS LIKE, ENGLAND'S
178th FINEST HOUR.

906
00:47:07,091 --> 00:47:08,959
ABOUT COP!

907
00:47:10,728 --> 00:47:12,830
THE JAPANESE THAT LIES DORMANT
IN ALL OF US

908
00:47:12,830 --> 00:47:14,965
COMES TO THE SURFACE
IN SITUATIONS LIKE THESE.

909
00:47:14,965 --> 00:47:18,369
MM-HMM. OOPS!

910
00:47:18,369 --> 00:47:20,071
OVER HERE!

911
00:47:20,071 --> 00:47:22,707
- SIT! YOU... SIT!
- [ROARING]

912
00:47:22,707 --> 00:47:24,575
HEY, THAT'S PLYMOUTH
IN ENGLAND.

913
00:47:27,244 --> 00:47:28,913
FREE HUEY!

914
00:47:31,615 --> 00:47:33,350
FLAME THROWER!

915
00:47:35,052 --> 00:47:37,988
THIS IS TRULY A BLACK DAY
IN THE HISTORY OF DORKIN.

916
00:47:37,988 --> 00:47:40,091
WILL THIS STOP
ENGLAND'S DORKIN?

917
00:47:42,827 --> 00:47:45,196
KIND OF LOOKS LIKE
A CHOCOLATE BUNNY.

918
00:47:46,263 --> 00:47:48,265
- WELL, LOOKS LIKE A CROW.
- HMM!

919
00:47:49,667 --> 00:47:52,536
OOH, I DIDN'T KNOW
ELEPHANTS EXPLODED ON IMPACT.

920
00:47:55,606 --> 00:47:58,075
COME ON THIS WAY.
WE'LL TAKE THE OTHER SIDE.

921
00:48:01,078 --> 00:48:04,281
- [SCREAMING]
- WE'VE INSTALLED THIS SYSTEM
RATHER THAN THE TRADITIONAL

922
00:48:04,281 --> 00:48:07,351
HAND TOWELS, GORGO--
IT PREVENTS CHAPPING AND
THE SPREAD OF DISEASE.

923
00:48:09,987 --> 00:48:11,522
I'M A DISTRACTION FOR MOTHRA.

924
00:48:11,522 --> 00:48:13,591
IF I DON'T COME BACK,
HE'S GONNA WRECK THIS JOINT!

925
00:48:15,392 --> 00:48:17,561
GIVE HIM ANOTHER BLAST!

926
00:48:17,561 --> 00:48:20,698
EMBARRASS HIM! ASK HIM ABOUT
THE SIZE OF HIS BRAIN.

927
00:48:26,003 --> 00:48:29,140
- POUR IT IN!
- LOOK, CAN I JUST EAT
MANCHESTER?

928
00:48:34,278 --> 00:48:36,347
RIGHT IN THE STORE.
WOW.

929
00:48:37,481 --> 00:48:39,717
QUIT DRAGGIN' TAIL, GORGO.
COME ON.

930
00:48:46,757 --> 00:48:49,827
POOR GUY WAS JUST THERE FOR
"TAKE YOUR BROTHER TO WORK" DAY.

931
00:48:49,827 --> 00:48:50,961
DAMN!

932
00:48:52,396 --> 00:48:54,231
GORGO GAVE HIMSELF
A LITTLE TIME OUT.

933
00:48:57,334 --> 00:48:59,970
- ♪♪ [SIRENS WAILING]
- BUSES REALLY RUN FREQUENTLY
HERE IN LONDON.

934
00:49:03,340 --> 00:49:05,109
"COME SEE GORGO.
HE'LL KILL YOUR FAMILY!

935
00:49:05,109 --> 00:49:07,444
COME, GET KILLED BY GORGO!"

936
00:49:10,247 --> 00:49:11,782
"BROKEN," WITH
JOHN COLLINS' BIG DIPPER.

937
00:49:17,254 --> 00:49:19,990
HAPPY COUPLES, ENJOYING
DORKIN ALL NIGHT LONG!

938
00:49:26,964 --> 00:49:29,834
HEY, IT IS BALLOONS.

939
00:49:29,834 --> 00:49:31,769
- UH-HUH.
- [CHUCKLES]

940
00:49:33,070 --> 00:49:35,473
INSULATION ON A STICK!

941
00:49:35,473 --> 00:49:38,008
[BARKER] EVERYBODY IN THE WORLD
IS TALKING ABOUT GORGO,

942
00:49:38,008 --> 00:49:39,777
BUT ONLY YOU CAN SEE HIM.

943
00:49:39,777 --> 00:49:42,079
AND ONLY HERE AT DORKINS.

944
00:49:42,079 --> 00:49:44,882
FIVE SHILLINGS,
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,

945
00:49:44,882 --> 00:49:46,650
BRING THE CHILDREN.
VERY INSTRUCTIVE.

946
00:49:46,650 --> 00:49:49,520
THIS WAY. HURRY, HURRY, HURRY
TO SEE GORGO,

947
00:49:49,520 --> 00:49:52,423
THE LAST REMAINING LINK
WITH PREHISTORIC TIMES!

948
00:49:52,423 --> 00:49:54,625
ONLY FIVE SHILLINGS,
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN.

949
00:49:54,625 --> 00:49:58,529
- HURRAY FOR DORKIN!
- FIVE SHILLINGS TO SEE GORGO!
THERE'S STILL A FEW PLACES!

950
00:49:58,529 --> 00:50:01,732
VIEWING BOTH SIDES,
BRING THE CHILDREN.
VERY INSTRUCTIVE.

951
00:50:01,732 --> 00:50:03,701
WHAT'S THAT, MADAM?
LOOKS LIKE YOUR HUSBAND?

952
00:50:03,701 --> 00:50:05,502
GO INSIDE TO FIND OUT!

953
00:50:05,502 --> 00:50:08,873
SIXTY-FIVE FOOT HIGH GORGO!
AND HEAVIER THAN SIX ELEPHANTS!

954
00:50:10,174 --> 00:50:12,443
"OH, THAT HIS TOO,
TOO SOLID FLESH/ WOULD MELT,

955
00:50:12,443 --> 00:50:15,346
AND RESOLVE ITSELF
INTO A DEW."

956
00:50:17,615 --> 00:50:19,617
IT'S REJECT DAY
AT THE CIRCUS.

957
00:50:21,285 --> 00:50:24,054
ICE CREAM HERE!
GET YOUR ICE CREAM!

958
00:50:24,054 --> 00:50:27,958
♪ MR. BO-JANGLES ♪

959
00:50:27,958 --> 00:50:29,693
♪ PEANUTS, TOASTED ♪

960
00:50:29,693 --> 00:50:31,962
HEY, JOHN QUINCY ADAMS!

961
00:50:33,030 --> 00:50:34,498
PEANUTS HERE.

962
00:50:34,498 --> 00:50:37,668
- [ROARING]
- ♪ IT'S NOT UNUSUAL-- ♪
THANK YOU!

963
00:50:37,668 --> 00:50:40,738
[PEOPLE HAWKING SNACKS]

964
00:50:42,606 --> 00:50:44,608
MM, BRAIN MATTER!

965
00:50:48,479 --> 00:50:50,915
HI THERE, CUTEY.

966
00:50:54,018 --> 00:50:56,053
HEY, LADIES. I KNOW GORGO.
WANT TO MEET HIM?

967
00:50:59,456 --> 00:51:01,625
LOOKS LIKE A FULL HOUSE.

968
00:51:01,625 --> 00:51:03,727
- NOT BAD.
- THAT'S WHY I'M DORKIN.

969
00:51:06,730 --> 00:51:10,367
♪ DON'T BREAK MY HEART
BREAKY-BREAKY HEART... ♪

970
00:51:10,367 --> 00:51:13,103
GREAT. COLONEL TOM PARKER'S
GONNA MANAGE GORGO.

971
00:51:18,208 --> 00:51:20,377
NEXT SHOW IN HALF AN HOUR,
MR. GORGO.

972
00:51:21,445 --> 00:51:24,248
HI, SAM.

973
00:51:24,248 --> 00:51:27,217
- I WAS DRIVING INTO TOWN.
- HAVE FUN.

974
00:51:27,217 --> 00:51:29,820
THOUGHT YOU MIGHT
LIKE TO COME ALONG,
HAVE A COUPLE OF DRINKS.

975
00:51:29,820 --> 00:51:33,424
- I'M HAVING A COUPLE OF DRINKS.
- I'M JUST TEARING THROUGH
THE PINK SQUIRRELS.

976
00:51:33,424 --> 00:51:36,527
- HOW'S BUSINESS?
- GREAT! GREAT.

977
00:51:36,527 --> 00:51:39,663
WHY DON'T YOU GET OUT
OF THIS DUMP? LIVE A LITTLE.

978
00:51:39,663 --> 00:51:41,999
I'VE GOT A SUITE OF ROOMS
AT THE BEST HOTEL IN TOWN

979
00:51:41,999 --> 00:51:46,203
- GORGO'S GOT
THE BIG BED, BUT...
- THIS SUITS US.

980
00:51:46,203 --> 00:51:50,174
- [TRUMPETING]
- GREAT. GORGO ATE
ANOTHER ELEPHANT.

981
00:51:53,911 --> 00:51:56,547
LOOK JOE, THESE ANIMALS
ARE GONE CRAZY.

982
00:51:56,547 --> 00:51:58,582
SOMETHING'S GONNA HAPPEN.
I CAN FEEL IT.

983
00:51:58,582 --> 00:52:00,317
MIKE'S ALREADY BEEN KILLED.
WHO'S GONNA BE NEXT?

984
00:52:00,317 --> 00:52:01,852
I'M AS SORRY ABOUT MIKE
AS YOU ARE.

985
00:52:01,852 --> 00:52:03,253
BUT IT WAS A TOUGH BREAK,
THAT'S ALL.

986
00:52:03,253 --> 00:52:05,622
BUT HE'S GOT A WIFE,
AND TWO KIDS.

987
00:52:05,622 --> 00:52:08,158
OKAY, WELL, WE'LL SEND HIM
SOME MONEY.

988
00:52:08,158 --> 00:52:10,394
- BUT HE'S DEAD!
- OKAY, WE'LL SEND HER
ANOTHER HUSBAND!

989
00:52:10,394 --> 00:52:13,630
THERE'S GONNA BE
A LOT MORE "TOUGH BREAKS"
BEFORE THIS IS OVER.

990
00:52:13,630 --> 00:52:16,033
YOU'VE BEEN LISTENING
TO YOUR NEW PRAVDA TOO MUCH.

991
00:52:16,033 --> 00:52:19,336
NO. I'VE BEEN LISTENING
TO MYSELF.

992
00:52:19,336 --> 00:52:22,206
- [TELEPHONE RINGS]
- WELL, THAT'LL BE ME AGAIN.

993
00:52:24,508 --> 00:52:26,744
- HELLO?
- ROWR!!!

994
00:52:26,744 --> 00:52:28,812
YEAH, JUST A MOMENT.

995
00:52:28,812 --> 00:52:30,781
THE PROFESSOR SAYS
THEY'VE BEEN TRYING TO FIND YOU.

996
00:52:30,781 --> 00:52:34,018
- YOU KNOW WHERE YOU ARE?
- THIS TIME OF NIGHT?

997
00:52:34,018 --> 00:52:37,921
- HELLO? YEAH.
- I'M SMOKING, SURE. YEAH.

998
00:52:37,921 --> 00:52:40,424
YEAH, IF YOU SAY SO.

999
00:52:40,424 --> 00:52:43,894
- OKAY.
- WELL, I'M SUPPOSED TO HIT YOU.

1000
00:52:43,894 --> 00:52:46,030
HE'S FOUND SOMETHING OUT.
ARE YOU COMING ALONG?

1001
00:52:46,030 --> 00:52:49,099
- YEAH, SURE.
- AND WE'LL GO BEAT UP
SOME CLOWNS.

1002
00:52:50,667 --> 00:52:53,203
- ♪♪ [CIRCUS MUSIC]
- ♪♪ [HUMMING ALONG]

1003
00:52:53,203 --> 00:52:56,807
- [DOOR CLOSING]
- BUT I DON'T WANT TO BE
BILLY MUMY!

1004
00:53:02,279 --> 00:53:04,081
I HOPE MONEYPENNY'S
HAPPY TO SEE ME.

1005
00:53:05,716 --> 00:53:07,985
HOLY WORM'S BUSIEST DAY EVER.

1006
00:53:07,985 --> 00:53:10,721
COME IN, GENTLEMEN.

1007
00:53:10,721 --> 00:53:12,189
- CAPTAIN RYAN.
- YES.

1008
00:53:12,189 --> 00:53:16,060
THE CREATURE YOU HAVE CAPTURED
IS NOT AN ADULT SPECIMEN.

1009
00:53:16,060 --> 00:53:18,729
- IT ISN'T FULLY GROWN?
- NO. IN FACT, WE BELIEVE

1010
00:53:18,729 --> 00:53:20,531
IT IS IN
RATHER EARLY INFANCY.

1011
00:53:20,531 --> 00:53:22,933
YOU'LL NEED TO CHANGE HIM.

1012
00:53:22,933 --> 00:53:26,136
ARE YOU TRYING TO SAY THERE
MAY BE A FULLY-GROWN ONE OF
THESE THINGS AROUND SOMEWHERE?

1013
00:53:26,136 --> 00:53:28,405
IT'S A FAIR ASSUMPTION.
WHERE THERE ARE OFFSPRING,

1014
00:53:28,405 --> 00:53:30,340
THERE ARE GENERALLY PARENTS.

1015
00:53:30,340 --> 00:53:32,142
HOW BIG WOULD
A FULL-GROWN ONE BE?

1016
00:53:32,142 --> 00:53:36,280
- OH, AN APPROXIMATE GUESS--
- ACCORDING TO MY
UNNECESSARILY LARGE BOOK--

1017
00:53:37,581 --> 00:53:39,783
THE INFANT--
- THE "OUT-FANT--"

1018
00:53:39,783 --> 00:53:41,452
THE ADULT.

1019
00:53:42,719 --> 00:53:44,488
THAT'LL MAKE HER NEARLY
200-FEET TALL!

1020
00:53:44,488 --> 00:53:46,723
- AT THE VERY LEAST.
- OBVIOUSLY THE PROPER
AUTHORITIES

1021
00:53:46,723 --> 00:53:49,326
- MUST BE NOTIFIED AT ONCE.
- WHAT ARE YOU TRYING TO DO?

1022
00:53:49,326 --> 00:53:53,397
STIR UP A WHOLE HORNETS' NEST
BECAUSE OF A FEW CALCULATIONS
MADE ON A PIECE OF PAPER?

1023
00:53:53,397 --> 00:53:55,399
- NUTS TO THAT.
- I'M AFRAID, CAPTAIN RYAN,

1024
00:53:55,399 --> 00:53:57,734
THE DECISION IS NO LONGER
IN YOUR HANDS.

1025
00:53:59,736 --> 00:54:02,873
ONE, TWO, THREE, STEP!
TWO-- NO, WRONG!

1026
00:54:02,873 --> 00:54:05,509
PRACTICE, PRACTICE, PRACTICE.
TWO. THREE.

1027
00:54:06,710 --> 00:54:09,279
BOY, THESE LATE SHOWS,
NOBODY EVER COMES.

1028
00:54:09,279 --> 00:54:13,684
- [GROWLING]
- HEY, KID. WANT TO PLAY
"ME EAT YOU"?

1029
00:54:18,489 --> 00:54:22,860
- HMM. WHAT'S THAT?
- OH, PAIN, ARRR!

1030
00:54:22,860 --> 00:54:25,963
WHAT DID THEY JUST EXPERIENCE?
OH, YAH. PAIN! ARRR--

1031
00:54:27,164 --> 00:54:29,800
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

1032
00:54:29,800 --> 00:54:33,504
- [DOG HOWLING, BARKING]
- OOH, HE'S GOT BETTY DAVIS EYE.

1033
00:54:33,504 --> 00:54:36,039
- REAL BAD, TOO--
- RIGHT.

1034
00:54:36,039 --> 00:54:38,475
I HELD MY BREATH FOR A MILLION
YEARS, DIDN'T YOU SEE?

1035
00:54:41,745 --> 00:54:44,448
QUIET, I'M FINISHING
A MONOLOGUE FOR BILLY WHITELAW.

1036
00:54:47,718 --> 00:54:49,786
AAH! I STUBBED MY TOE
ON A DUPLEX!

1037
00:54:51,722 --> 00:54:54,958
THAT'S THE ROAD COMPANY
OF STOMP.

1038
00:54:54,958 --> 00:54:56,660
[GROANING]

1039
00:54:57,728 --> 00:54:59,129
- [ROARING]
- [SCREAMING]

1040
00:54:59,129 --> 00:55:01,665
I'M THE NEW HARBOR MASTER.
YEAH.

1041
00:55:09,473 --> 00:55:12,976
AHH. THIS FEELS GREAT.
OH, MY ACHIN' DOGS!

1042
00:55:17,114 --> 00:55:20,717
ADMIRAL BROOKS, I REALIZE
THE SITUATION IS FANTASTIC,

1043
00:55:20,717 --> 00:55:23,487
ONE EXPECTS THE FANTASTIC
FROM YOU SCIENTISTS THESE DAYS.

1044
00:55:23,487 --> 00:55:25,756
- STUPID SQUID.
- TELL ME, ADMIRAL.

1045
00:55:25,756 --> 00:55:28,425
HAVE YOU EVER THE SEEN
THE ANIMAL THAT WAS CAPTURED?

1046
00:55:28,425 --> 00:55:31,461
- I'M AFRAID
I HAVEN'T HAD THE TIME.
- THEN YOU SHOULD TAKE THE TIME.

1047
00:55:31,461 --> 00:55:33,263
- MM-HMM.
- AND WHEN YOU DO,

1048
00:55:33,263 --> 00:55:36,567
- REMEMBER, IT FIRST APPEARED
AT GNARA ISLAND.
- [KNOCKING]

1049
00:55:36,567 --> 00:55:38,902
MONITOR REPORTS THERE'S BEEN
NO COMMUNICATION

1050
00:55:38,902 --> 00:55:40,671
WITH GNARA ISLAND
FOR THREE DAYS, SIR.

1051
00:55:40,671 --> 00:55:43,774
- THANK YOU, TIMMY.
- THREE DAYS?

1052
00:55:43,774 --> 00:55:45,842
OH, AND PINAFORE'S 
ABOUT TO START, SIR.

1053
00:55:47,911 --> 00:55:50,614
 HER MAJESTY'S AIRCRAFT
 CARRIER, ROYAL OAK, 

1054
00:55:50,614 --> 00:55:52,749
 FROM THE ADMIRALTY, WHITEHALL.

1055
00:55:52,749 --> 00:55:55,018
PROCEED TO AREA N-34.

1056
00:55:55,018 --> 00:55:57,754
AND REPORT ANY UNUSUAL
SIGHTINGS OR CONDITIONS

1057
00:55:57,754 --> 00:56:00,123
IN VICINITY OF GNARA ISLAND.

1058
00:56:00,123 --> 00:56:02,693
THIS IS PRIORITY A. REPEAT--

1059
00:56:02,693 --> 00:56:04,828
- [BATTLE STATIONS ALARMS]
- THIS IS PRIORITY A.

1060
00:56:04,828 --> 00:56:06,863
WOOT!

1061
00:56:06,863 --> 00:56:08,131
♪ ONE ♪

1062
00:56:13,036 --> 00:56:15,205
MEANWHILE, BITS OF
THE EMPIRE HAVE FALLEN AWAY--

1063
00:56:15,205 --> 00:56:18,809
SO LONG, INDIA!
GOOD-BYE, RHODESIA!

1064
00:56:21,812 --> 00:56:23,480
TALMUD! TALMU--
OH, WAIT. I MEAN,

1065
00:56:23,480 --> 00:56:25,916
"TORAH, TORAH, TO--"

1066
00:56:25,916 --> 00:56:27,784
[MUFFLED, AS IF SPEAKING
THOUGH AIR MASK]

1067
00:56:29,052 --> 00:56:31,121
LEAVE ME ALONE!
GET AWAY FROM ME!

1068
00:56:33,457 --> 00:56:36,893
- [BATTLE STATIONS WHOOPING]
- THE S.S. CURLY HAS ARRIVED.

1069
00:56:36,893 --> 00:56:38,762
[IMITATING CURLY THE STOOGE]
WHOO! WHOO-WHOO-WHOOP,
NYUK, NYUK.

1070
00:56:41,565 --> 00:56:45,102
MM, THERE'S A SPOT
ON MY WINDOW.

1071
00:56:45,102 --> 00:56:47,204
I'M DRAWING BINKY.

1072
00:56:47,204 --> 00:56:49,573
RECONNAISSANCE TO CORVETTE:

1073
00:56:49,573 --> 00:56:51,642
ALTER COURSE TO 3-1-0.

1074
00:56:51,642 --> 00:56:53,877
REPEAT: COURSE 3-1-0.

1075
00:56:55,379 --> 00:56:58,282
- [WHOOP]
- [IMITATING CURLY]
SOYTANLY! NYUK, NYUK...

1076
00:56:58,282 --> 00:57:02,586
- [WHOOP]
- RIGHT! THEY SPOTTED SOMETHING,
SIR. PORT FOUR POINTS.

1077
00:57:03,720 --> 00:57:05,856
- PORT. FOUR POINTS.
- AYE-AYE, SIR.

1078
00:57:05,856 --> 00:57:09,426
WE'RE GOIN' OVER
OUR OWN WAKE. IT'S FUN!

1079
00:57:09,426 --> 00:57:10,928
DEPLOY PITCHING MACHINE.

1080
00:57:14,164 --> 00:57:17,100
THE ORDER COMES IN:
"KILL WILLY".

1081
00:57:21,838 --> 00:57:24,107
SHE HAS PERM RODS IN HER HAIR.

1082
00:57:25,942 --> 00:57:28,312
- MAN, I LOVE PRELL.
- FIRE NUMBER ONE, CURRY!

1083
00:57:30,480 --> 00:57:33,550
NO, WAIT, WAIT. WE CAN'T
ALL BE NUMBER ONE TURRET!

1084
00:57:36,987 --> 00:57:38,822
- [CHUCKLES]
- OOH.

1085
00:57:41,291 --> 00:57:43,627
LOOK AT THIS. DOORMEN JUST
ROAM THE STREETS OF LONDON,

1086
00:57:43,627 --> 00:57:46,196
LOOKING FOR PEOPLE TO SERVE--

1087
00:57:46,196 --> 00:57:48,198
- [MORSE CODE]
- I WILL NOT FAKE
DISTRESS CALLS.

1088
00:57:48,198 --> 00:57:49,866
I WILL NOT FAKE
DISTRESS CALLS.

1089
00:57:52,069 --> 00:57:55,539
- ADMIRAL BROOKS.
- [CROW] WE'VE DECIDED
ENGLAND IS SHAPED FUNNY.

1090
00:57:55,539 --> 00:57:57,808
GENTLEMEN, YOU'VE BEEN ASKED
TO COME HERE,

1091
00:57:57,808 --> 00:57:59,876
TO SUPPLY US
WITH ANY INFORMATION
IN YOUR POSSESSION

1092
00:57:59,876 --> 00:58:00,911
WHICH MIGHT BE HELPFUL.

1093
00:58:00,911 --> 00:58:03,413
GNARA ISLAND
HAS BEEN DESTROYED.

1094
00:58:03,413 --> 00:58:06,249
RECONNAISSANCE AIRCRAFT
HAVE SIGHTED A CREATURE

1095
00:58:06,249 --> 00:58:08,218
- IN THIS AREA HERE.
- EXCUSE ME, SIR.

1096
00:58:08,218 --> 00:58:09,920
THAT LOOKS AS THOUGH
THE THING'S HEADING FOR ENGLAND.

1097
00:58:09,920 --> 00:58:12,823
QUITE. AND THAT IN ITSELF
CALLS FOR AN EXPLANATION.

1098
00:58:12,823 --> 00:58:14,458
DO YOU HAVE ONE?

1099
00:58:14,458 --> 00:58:17,527
WELL, WE WERE PLAYING
A STREAM OF WATER ON IT
DURING THE PASSAGE.

1100
00:58:17,527 --> 00:58:19,996
BUT IT WAS PROFESSOR FLAHERTY'S
INSTRUCTIONS.

1101
00:58:19,996 --> 00:58:22,165
MAYBE HE LEFT
SOME SORT OF... TRACK.

1102
00:58:22,165 --> 00:58:23,834
- I SEE.
- WAY TO GO!

1103
00:58:23,834 --> 00:58:26,803
- IS THAT POSSIBLE?
- YES, IT'S POSSIBLE.

1104
00:58:26,803 --> 00:58:29,473
THE ROYAL OAKS 
FOR ADMIRAL CROOKS, PLEASE.

1105
00:58:29,473 --> 00:58:31,608
 ROYAL OAKS COMING IN
FOR ADMIRAL BOOKS.

1106
00:58:31,608 --> 00:58:33,410
- GO ON.
- MY CHACO IS HERE.

1107
00:58:33,410 --> 00:58:36,546
THEY REPORT AT LEAST
TWO DIRECT HITS.

1108
00:58:36,546 --> 00:58:39,516
- YOU KILLED IT?
- IT DISAPPEARED
BENEATH THE SEA.

1109
00:58:39,516 --> 00:58:41,118
THEY SATURATED THE AREA
WITH DEPTH CHARGES.

1110
00:58:41,118 --> 00:58:44,154
NO LIVING THING COULD ESCAPE.
IT'S CERTAINLY BEEN KILLED.

1111
00:58:45,255 --> 00:58:47,657
- [WHOOPING]
- "WE KILLED IT, MO!"

1112
00:58:47,657 --> 00:58:49,559
[CHUCKLES]

1113
00:58:51,094 --> 00:58:53,130
A GIANT SEA CAMEL!

1114
00:58:56,466 --> 00:58:58,268
AH, PORK-FED BRITS!

1115
00:59:02,139 --> 00:59:03,840
[EXPECTORATING]
UGH.

1116
00:59:07,978 --> 00:59:10,514
THERE'S GOT TO BE
A MORNING AFTER ZORD!

1117
00:59:10,514 --> 00:59:13,784
- JIM!
- CAPSIZED.

1118
00:59:13,784 --> 00:59:15,786
I'VE GOT TO HAVE
MY "CAP" SIZED.

1119
00:59:15,786 --> 00:59:17,421
[DISAPPROVING LAUGHTER]

1120
00:59:17,421 --> 00:59:19,556
WITH EVERY MAN ABOARD.

1121
00:59:20,824 --> 00:59:22,492
THIS IS TERRIBLE.

1122
00:59:22,492 --> 00:59:25,929
- I SEE IT AS AN OPPORTUNITY.
- WELL, ALL RIGHT. NOW WHAT?

1123
00:59:25,929 --> 00:59:27,164
- WHAT WILL YOU DO?
- TURN NOTHING AT THE FESTIVAL
GARDENS LOOSE. WHAT ELSE?

1124
00:59:29,766 --> 00:59:31,601
TAKE IT BACK TO THE SEA
WHILE WE STILL HAVE A CHANCE.

1125
00:59:31,601 --> 00:59:34,337
WHAT THE HELL'S THE MATTER WITH
YOU? THIS IS THE 20th CENTURY.

1126
00:59:34,337 --> 00:59:36,339
THERE MUST BE SOME WAY OF
HANDLING AN OVERGROWN ANIMAL!

1127
00:59:36,339 --> 00:59:39,342
THERE'S NO DOUBT THAT
WE CAN STOP THE CREATURE.

1128
00:59:39,342 --> 00:59:42,279
WE'LL CALL YOU
IF WE NEED YOU AGAIN.
GOOD EVENING, GENTLEMEN.

1129
00:59:42,279 --> 00:59:44,114
BUT COULD YOU POSTPONE
YOUR PLANS TO BRING

1130
00:59:44,114 --> 00:59:47,050
THE 500-FOOT STICK INSECT
INTO THE MIDDLE OF LONDON?

1131
00:59:55,625 --> 00:59:59,095
AHH... DORKIN JUST DOESN'T
SEEM THE SAME NOW.

1132
00:59:59,095 --> 01:00:01,164
NOPE.

1133
01:00:03,333 --> 01:00:05,602
- GOOD NIGHT, GORGO.
- RARR...

1134
01:00:06,970 --> 01:00:09,306
THE CLOWNS LET ME BORROW
THEIR CAR-- IT'S GREAT!

1135
01:00:12,242 --> 01:00:15,111
WELL, I DO LIVE IN A TRAILER.
I THOUGHT I'D LISTEN
TO SOME BOB SEGER

1136
01:00:15,111 --> 01:00:18,715
- AND WATCH NASCAR.
- SAM! STOP! HE'LL KILL YOU.

1137
01:00:18,715 --> 01:00:21,384
- TURN HIM LOOSE.
- STOP IT, SAM!

1138
01:00:21,384 --> 01:00:23,320
- HE'LL KILL YOU!
- I'LL TAKE THE CHANCE.

1139
01:00:24,688 --> 01:00:28,124
- LET HIM GO!
- DON'T DO IT, SAM!

1140
01:00:28,124 --> 01:00:30,060
DON'T VOMIT ON ME AGAIN!

1141
01:00:30,060 --> 01:00:32,329
[GROWLING]

1142
01:00:33,430 --> 01:00:36,399
COME ON.

1143
01:00:36,399 --> 01:00:38,668
- [GORGO ROARS]
- SAM, DON'T! PLEASE!

1144
01:00:38,668 --> 01:00:41,104
DON'T FUSS SO OVER ME.
PLEASE.

1145
01:00:42,205 --> 01:00:46,943
- FEM PUNCH. WHOO.
- [TRUMPETING]

1146
01:00:46,943 --> 01:00:49,346
SAM, YOU'RE CRAZY.

1147
01:00:49,346 --> 01:00:52,015
- HMM. I LIKE PUNCHING YOU.
- SAM!

1148
01:00:52,015 --> 01:00:54,351
- SAM! SAM!
- WE'RE GOING TO THE VET, RIGHT?

1149
01:00:54,351 --> 01:00:57,387
ARE YOU OKAY? SAM!
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

1150
01:00:57,387 --> 01:00:59,155
- SAM.
- YOU MADE THE PANTS TOO LONG!

1151
01:00:59,155 --> 01:01:00,657
- SAM.
- HE'S ALL RIGHT, KID.

1152
01:01:02,759 --> 01:01:06,796
♪ FAIL BRITANNIA
YOU NEVER RULED THE WAVES ♪

1153
01:01:06,796 --> 01:01:08,598
OUCH.

1154
01:01:13,637 --> 01:01:15,572
- PA, COME HERE.
- [CHUCKLING]

1155
01:01:17,941 --> 01:01:21,144
WELL, WE'VE TAKEN OUT THE QE2,
 THE BISMARCK AND THE LOVE BOAT,

1156
01:01:21,144 --> 01:01:23,780
BUT WE'VE MISSED GORGO.

1157
01:01:23,780 --> 01:01:25,081
OH, LOOK WHAT
THE NEIGHBORS ARE DOING!

1158
01:01:25,081 --> 01:01:28,018
AMUNDSEN TO CORVETTE.
OBSERVATION NEGATIVE.

1159
01:01:28,018 --> 01:01:30,086
REPEAT, NEGATIVE!

1160
01:01:30,086 --> 01:01:32,289
CAN I GET SOME HELP HERE?
THERE'S USUALLY A GUY

1161
01:01:32,289 --> 01:01:34,291
WITH A THING?

1162
01:01:40,297 --> 01:01:43,066
...FIRE WITH ALL HANDS,
THE ADMIRALTY HAS DEPLOYED

1163
01:01:43,066 --> 01:01:46,503
MAJOR FORCES OF THE NATO FLEET,
OFF THREE MILES OF THE ESTUARY.

1164
01:01:46,503 --> 01:01:49,172
 IN AN ATTEMPT TO LOCATE
 AND DESTROY THE MONSTER,

1165
01:01:49,172 --> 01:01:52,242
 EVEN BEFORE IT REACHES
 THE COASTAL DEFENSES.

1166
01:01:52,242 --> 01:01:54,411
- [WHOOPING]
- THEY'RE FIRING GEESE AT HIM!

1167
01:01:57,080 --> 01:01:59,349
OW, OW, OW. OW. OW. OW.

1168
01:02:02,252 --> 01:02:05,722
R... R... R...
R... R... R... R.

1169
01:02:07,724 --> 01:02:10,393
THEY MUST GET EVERYTHING!

1170
01:02:10,393 --> 01:02:12,963
RESUME TRACKING. WEST-2-5.

1171
01:02:12,963 --> 01:02:15,065
BLACK ATTACK FORCE,
SEARCH 20 DEGREES WEST.

1172
01:02:16,499 --> 01:02:19,002
- [SHIP'S HORN BLEATS]
- [IMITATING GOAT] MA!

1173
01:02:27,944 --> 01:02:31,748
♪♪ [IMITATING TRUMPET]
OH, HE'S SO CUTE!

1174
01:02:31,748 --> 01:02:35,785
- IS ROGER LOOKING AT ME?
- LOOK AT THOSE TWO.
IT'S DISGUSTING.

1175
01:02:40,457 --> 01:02:42,859
[CHUCKLES]

1176
01:02:46,496 --> 01:02:48,064
YOU KNOW AT THIS POINT,
I'D BE GLAD TO SEE

1177
01:02:48,064 --> 01:02:50,400
- CHER STRADDLING THESE GUNS?
- MM.

1178
01:02:52,202 --> 01:02:54,804
ISN'T THIS CUTTING
INTO THE NAVY'S GROPING
AND HARASSMENT TIME?

1179
01:02:57,040 --> 01:02:59,075
THE ENGLISH REJECT BEER
THAT'S TOO COLD!

1180
01:03:05,048 --> 01:03:06,316
[CHUCKLING]

1181
01:03:06,316 --> 01:03:08,318
THIS IS THE EQUIVALENT
OF THE NAVY GETTING DRUNK

1182
01:03:08,318 --> 01:03:10,320
AND THROWING CHERRY BOMBS
OVERBOARD.

1183
01:03:10,320 --> 01:03:11,621
YUP.

1184
01:03:16,226 --> 01:03:18,828
TEN WHALES ARE DEAD, SIR!

1185
01:03:18,828 --> 01:03:20,764
DIVE, DIVE, DIVE!

1186
01:03:22,632 --> 01:03:25,869
WHOO--
WE ARE A SUBMARINE, RIGHT?

1187
01:03:25,869 --> 01:03:27,370
THIS IS GOOD.

1188
01:03:28,505 --> 01:03:30,440
OOH-OOH! I THINK
I JUST SAW LARRY HOVIS!

1189
01:03:30,440 --> 01:03:32,809
- [WHISPERS] OH! WHERE?
 - [SAILOR] THAT'S SECURE, SIR.

1190
01:03:34,744 --> 01:03:37,047
WHOOPS, WE LEFT THE CAPTAIN
IN THE CONNING TOWER.

1191
01:03:42,752 --> 01:03:45,522
STEADY AS SHE GOES
FOR TORPEDO ATTACK.

1192
01:03:45,522 --> 01:03:49,826
- COURSE 2-7-5. RANGE 1500.
- COURSE 2-7-5, SIR.

1193
01:03:49,826 --> 01:03:51,528
FIRING GAP.

1194
01:03:51,528 --> 01:03:53,830
READY TO OPEN FIRE, SIR.

1195
01:03:53,830 --> 01:03:57,400
- FIRE ONE!
- MOVIE MUCH LONGER THAN IT
WOULD HAVE BEEN WITHOUT US, SIR.

1196
01:03:58,735 --> 01:04:01,638
- FIRE TWO!
- CAN'T TALK NOW! BYE!

1197
01:04:03,840 --> 01:04:05,375
SECOND TARGET IS CIRCLING.

1198
01:04:05,375 --> 01:04:07,444
I NEED A BIGGER MONITOR.

1199
01:04:09,979 --> 01:04:12,048
BROKEN. TARGET MOVING
TOWARD THE ESTUARY.

1200
01:04:12,048 --> 01:04:13,783
TOO FAST TO FOLLOW.

1201
01:04:13,783 --> 01:04:16,686
GET ME SUBMARINE CONTROL.
SECTOR 2-8.

1202
01:04:18,655 --> 01:04:21,224
WE'RE JUST CLOSING THE LAST OF
THE SUBMARINE NETS NOW, SIR.

1203
01:04:21,224 --> 01:04:22,158
- MM-HMM.
- YES, SIR.

1204
01:04:24,060 --> 01:04:26,196
THIS MUST KEEP FOUL BALLS
OUT OF THE OCEAN.

1205
01:04:29,866 --> 01:04:32,068
- [BUZZING]
- UH, CIGARETTE ALERT!
EVERYBODY SMOKE!

1206
01:04:33,336 --> 01:04:36,473
YES? YES!
ONE MOMENT.

1207
01:04:36,473 --> 01:04:38,842
THE NETS HAVE BEEN TORN!
THEN THE CONNECTION WAS GONE.

1208
01:04:38,842 --> 01:04:42,278
I JUST GOT RED CONTACTS.
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

1209
01:04:42,278 --> 01:04:45,882
NICE. NOW, LIEUTENANT MODEST
CROTCH ON THE RIGHT HERE.

1210
01:04:45,882 --> 01:04:48,618
NO, THERE'S NOTHING FURTHER
YOU CAN DO NOW.

1211
01:04:48,618 --> 01:04:51,888
WELL, THEY'VE FORGOTTEN
YOUR MOO GOO GAI PAN.

1212
01:04:51,888 --> 01:04:55,759
THE CREATURE'S GOT THROUGH.
SMASHED THE NET.

1213
01:04:55,759 --> 01:04:57,327
GET ME RIVER PATROL.

1214
01:04:57,327 --> 01:05:01,131
- UH-OH.
- [IMITATING FAT ALBERT]
HEY, HEY, HEY! IT'S FAT ALBERT.

1215
01:05:01,131 --> 01:05:03,333
[GROWLING]

1216
01:05:03,333 --> 01:05:05,068
NOW, IS THIS THE MOM,
OR THE DAD?

1217
01:05:05,068 --> 01:05:07,403
I DON'T KNOW. HOW DO YOU
SEX ONE OF THESE THINGS?

1218
01:05:07,403 --> 01:05:10,106
WELL, YOU PUT THE LIGHTS
DOWN LOW, YOU PUT ON
A LITTLE BARRY WHITE--

1219
01:05:10,106 --> 01:05:11,941
- THAT'S NOT LIKE YOU.
- YOU KNOW. RIGHT.

1220
01:05:11,941 --> 01:05:13,576
RIDICULOUS.

1221
01:05:13,576 --> 01:05:16,913
- I'M JUST NOW COMING BACK--
- WHAT THE HELL, THIS GUY--

1222
01:05:16,913 --> 01:05:19,883
[NARRATOR] I CAN SEE
THE HUGE BEAST STILL ADVANCING.

1223
01:05:19,883 --> 01:05:21,484
A SECOND LINE OF DEFENSE
HAS BEEN ORGANIZED,

1224
01:05:21,484 --> 01:05:23,186
GREATLY REINFORCED.

1225
01:05:35,965 --> 01:05:38,768
- WELL, HEY, WHAT'S THIS?
- LOOKS LIKE THE NANITES

1226
01:05:38,768 --> 01:05:40,503
MADE THEMSELVES
A LITTLE CIRCUS.

1227
01:05:40,503 --> 01:05:42,305
HA, THEY MUST HAVE BEEN
WATCHING THE MOVIE,

1228
01:05:42,305 --> 01:05:45,742
- THE LITTLE DICKENSES.
- WELL, LET'S SEE.

1229
01:05:45,742 --> 01:05:48,645
HELLO, NANITES?
WHAT'S GOING ON DOWN THERE?

1230
01:05:48,645 --> 01:05:54,450
- [ELEPHANT TRUMPETING]
- L-LADIES AND GENTLEMEN!

1231
01:05:54,450 --> 01:05:56,419
CHILDREN OF ALL AGES!

1232
01:05:56,419 --> 01:05:59,522
COME TO THE SPECTACULAR,
GARGANTUAN NANITE BROTHERS

1233
01:05:59,522 --> 01:06:03,393
AND DORKIN COMBINED AVIONIC
CIRCUS AND CARNIVAL OF SOUL!

1234
01:06:03,393 --> 01:06:07,764
- NATE THE CLOWN!
- MARVEL AT THE SPECTACLE OF
WILD, SUB-CELLULAR ANIMALS!

1235
01:06:07,764 --> 01:06:11,201
WHAT'S A-- NATE THE CLOWN!
- THRILL AT THE DARING OF
THE NANITE TINO FAMILY

1236
01:06:11,201 --> 01:06:14,504
AS THEY FLY UP
ALL 50 BACKGROUNDS
ABOVE CENTER RING!

1237
01:06:14,504 --> 01:06:15,572
NATE THE CLOWN.

1238
01:06:15,572 --> 01:06:17,607
WELL, IT SOUNDS GREAT!

1239
01:06:17,607 --> 01:06:21,010
- HOW MUCH DOES IT COST?
- I'M NOT DONE YET, GUESS!

1240
01:06:21,010 --> 01:06:23,446
IN HORROR AT
THE LARGELY IRONIC MIDWAY,

1241
01:06:23,446 --> 01:06:27,417
AND SQUEAL WITH DELIGHT AT
THE ANTICS OF NATE THE CLOWN!

1242
01:06:27,417 --> 01:06:31,054
HEY! THAT'S ME!
[TRYING TO LAUGH]

1243
01:06:32,422 --> 01:06:36,960
[CHUCKLING]
OKAY, OKAY. YOU SOLD ME.
HOW MUCH?

1244
01:06:36,960 --> 01:06:41,798
ONLY TWENTY-FIVE CENTS,
THAT'S RIGHT, A QUARTER!

1245
01:06:41,798 --> 01:06:45,301
TWO BITS! FIVE NICKELS,
ONE QUARTER OF A GREENBACK.

1246
01:06:45,301 --> 01:06:48,104
WELL, I GOT A HANDFUL OF
QUARTERS. ARE YOU GUYS IN?

1247
01:06:48,104 --> 01:06:50,640
- YOU BET!
- I WANT TO SEE
THE IRONIC MIDWAY.

1248
01:06:50,640 --> 01:06:52,141
THERE YOU GO, PALLY.

1249
01:06:52,141 --> 01:06:56,546
OH, NO! OH, HORRORS! THE CURSE
OF THE CIRCUS IS UPON US!

1250
01:06:56,546 --> 01:07:01,050
GIANT STONES FALL FROM THE SKY,
AND OUR CLOWN IS DEAD! [SOBBING]

1251
01:07:01,050 --> 01:07:04,954
THE NIGHT BROTHERS ARE
ON THE LOOSE. THE AMOEBAS
ARE ON THE RUNWAY, SON!

1252
01:07:04,954 --> 01:07:07,523
RUN!

1253
01:07:07,523 --> 01:07:10,960
OH, SORRY. I WAS JUST TOSSING
ONE ON. I DON'T--

1254
01:07:10,960 --> 01:07:14,731
SAY! HERE COMES ANOTHER!
THE CIRCUS IS DESTROYED.

1255
01:07:14,731 --> 01:07:18,101
- OOF.
- MAYBE WE SHOULD GO
TO THE ZOO, INSTEAD.

1256
01:07:18,101 --> 01:07:20,303
THAT'S A GOOD IDEA.
WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

1257
01:07:20,303 --> 01:07:22,538
- CLOWN-KILLER!
- MAYBE.

1258
01:07:30,580 --> 01:07:33,216
- EEH.
- YOU GOT CLOWN BLOOD?

1259
01:07:33,216 --> 01:07:37,487
- I'M SAFE.
- YOU KNOW, I DON'T THINK
THE SANCTIONS ARE WORKING.

1260
01:07:39,422 --> 01:07:40,857
THE TWO LINES READY, SIR!

1261
01:07:43,226 --> 01:07:44,961
OPEN THE VALVES!

1262
01:07:44,961 --> 01:07:47,764
AH, THEY'RE GONNA GET IT DRUNK
ON WOODPECKER CIDER.

1263
01:07:51,267 --> 01:07:53,903
- ♪ DOWN-TOWN ♪
- ABANDON SHIP!

1264
01:07:53,903 --> 01:07:55,738
COME ON, HOP TO IT!

1265
01:07:57,040 --> 01:07:59,442
McHALE'S NAVY VALIANTLY
BATTLES THE CREATURE.

1266
01:07:59,442 --> 01:08:03,046
- WORK OUT.
- [ROARING]

1267
01:08:08,318 --> 01:08:10,153
COME ON! IT'S THE 5:15 MONSTER.

1268
01:08:10,153 --> 01:08:13,556
[ROARING]

1269
01:08:13,556 --> 01:08:16,626
LET'S GET READY.
UP HERE BEHIND THOSE SANDBAGS.

1270
01:08:16,626 --> 01:08:19,462
THIS FEELS GOOD, SQUISHING
THE MUD BETWEEN MY TOES.

1271
01:08:19,462 --> 01:08:21,164
FIRE!

1272
01:08:21,164 --> 01:08:22,932
GOT HIM. HE'S DEAD,
IT'S OVER. LET'S GO.

1273
01:08:22,932 --> 01:08:25,134
GOOD, LET'S GO. 

1274
01:08:25,134 --> 01:08:28,338
THIS IS A FINE WELCOME.
THEY TREATED JERRY LEE LEWIS
BETTER THAN THIS.

1275
01:08:30,173 --> 01:08:31,641
BOLLIX CARGO!

1276
01:08:36,346 --> 01:08:37,580
[CHUCKLING]

1277
01:08:37,580 --> 01:08:39,515
NOW THAT JUST SEEMED
COMPLETELY AVOIDABLE.

1278
01:08:46,522 --> 01:08:47,924
GET ME ARMY HEADQUARTERS.

1279
01:08:49,425 --> 01:08:51,260
NO, ATOMIC WEAPONS
ARE OUT OF THE QUESTION.

1280
01:08:51,260 --> 01:08:53,429
- IN ANY BUILT-UP AREA.
- WACKO!

1281
01:08:53,429 --> 01:08:54,497
TANKS? OF COURSE.

1282
01:08:54,497 --> 01:08:56,332
PULL OUT! PULL OUT!

1283
01:08:56,332 --> 01:08:58,901
- UP YOU GO.
- COME ON, LET'S DO
SOMETHING EASY,

1284
01:08:58,901 --> 01:09:01,137
LIKE PUT DOWN SOME ARABS
OR SOMETHING.

1285
01:09:04,374 --> 01:09:07,110
THOSE THINGS ARE GREAT.
THEY'RE BUILT LIKE VOLVOS.

1286
01:09:07,110 --> 01:09:10,146
ATTENTION. THIS IS
A SPECIAL BULLETIN.

1287
01:09:10,146 --> 01:09:13,449
CIVIL DEFENSE
AUTHORITIES HAVE DECLARED
A STATE OF EMERGENCY

1288
01:09:13,449 --> 01:09:16,853
FOR ALL LONDON AREAS
WITHIN THREE MILES
OF THE RIVER THAMES.

1289
01:09:16,853 --> 01:09:19,355
AH, HE'LL PROBABLY
BE SATED ON PEOPLE
FROM THE SUBURBS BY THEN.

1290
01:09:25,028 --> 01:09:27,230
[SIRENS, YELLING]

1291
01:09:27,230 --> 01:09:28,564
THERE'S A SALE ON BUMBERSHOOTS!

1292
01:09:28,564 --> 01:09:31,234
GET CLEAR FOR MILITARY
AND DEFENSE PERSONNEL.

1293
01:09:32,301 --> 01:09:33,970
NOT SO BAD. KEEP YOUR CHIN UP!

1294
01:09:33,970 --> 01:09:37,206
STIFF UPPER LIP!

1295
01:09:37,206 --> 01:09:41,377
STREETS MUST BE KEPT CLEAR
FOR MILITARY AND DEFENSE
PERSONNEL.

1296
01:09:41,377 --> 01:09:43,346
AND GOOD HUMOR TRUCKS.

1297
01:09:46,249 --> 01:09:49,419
AH, THE QUEEN MUM IS BROUGHT
OUT TO FIGHT THE BEAST.

1298
01:09:49,419 --> 01:09:51,687
[IMITATING QUEEN MUM]
HELL-O? HELLO?

1299
01:09:57,627 --> 01:09:59,896
ALL RIGHT, GUYS. YOU CAN GET
YOUR MEN UP THERE, IN FRONT.

1300
01:09:59,896 --> 01:10:02,131
[SHOUTING, YELLING]

1301
01:10:03,232 --> 01:10:04,701
- YES, SIR.
- ON THE DOUBLE!

1302
01:10:04,701 --> 01:10:06,536
BEING IN THE BRITISH ARMY
IS A CINCH. 

1303
01:10:06,536 --> 01:10:08,671
YOU JUST HOLD THE RIFLE,
AND RUN AROUND AND LOOK BUSY.

1304
01:10:08,671 --> 01:10:11,774
- COME ON!
- GET OFF THE STREETS!

1305
01:10:11,774 --> 01:10:15,044
 - GO TO YOUR HOMES! 
- NOW I KNOW WHAT
HE'S TALKING ABOUT, GUYS.

1306
01:10:15,044 --> 01:10:17,647
 YOU WILL BE NOTIFIED
 WHEN THE EMERGENCY IS OVER.

1307
01:10:17,647 --> 01:10:20,216
 GET OFF THE STREETS
 AND GO TO YOUR HOMES.

1308
01:10:20,216 --> 01:10:22,919
NOW TANKS ARE BROUGHT IN
TO ROLL OVER THE DOLL.

1309
01:10:22,919 --> 01:10:25,321
COME ON! GET A MOVE ON!

1310
01:10:27,757 --> 01:10:30,393
THIS IS THE SAME THING THEY DO
WHEN OLIVER REED'S IN TOWN.

1311
01:10:35,098 --> 01:10:36,833
CAN'T BELIEVE
WE ALL MISSED THE BUS.

1312
01:10:38,868 --> 01:10:40,770
UP THE RAMP THERE!
MOVE IN, MOVE IN!

1313
01:10:40,770 --> 01:10:42,872
- TAKE YOUR POSITIONS!
- [SIRENS BLARING]

1314
01:10:42,872 --> 01:10:44,373
FIRING POSITIONS!

1315
01:10:47,543 --> 01:10:48,878
- TOM?
- YES?

1316
01:10:48,878 --> 01:10:50,580
IT'S ADVANCING UP RIVER
DIRECTLY TOWARDS US.

1317
01:10:50,580 --> 01:10:51,681
STAY HERE AND GET KILLED?
YES, SIR!

1318
01:10:51,681 --> 01:10:53,783
VERY GOOD, SIR.

1319
01:10:53,783 --> 01:10:57,053
- LOOK, A WOMAN!
- ALTHOUGH THE ARMY
INDICATES FULL CONFIDENCE,

1320
01:10:57,053 --> 01:10:59,689
THEY REPORT GROWING CASUALTIES
AMONG THEIR FORCES.

1321
01:10:59,689 --> 01:11:02,125
WE ARE TOLD THAT DOWNING STREET
IS IN CONSTANT COMMUNICATION

1322
01:11:02,125 --> 01:11:04,927
WITH OTHER WORLD CAPITALS, WHERE
GRAVE CONCERN IS EXPRESSED.

1323
01:11:04,927 --> 01:11:06,863
THOUGHT I DETECTED
A SNICKER IN THEIR VOICE.

1324
01:11:06,863 --> 01:11:09,532
- [BLOWS WHISTLE]
- CALL HEADQUARTERS.

1325
01:11:09,532 --> 01:11:10,700
SHOOT THE FLARES!

1326
01:11:12,368 --> 01:11:14,604
OPEN SIGHT FIRE!
STAND BY!

1327
01:11:15,838 --> 01:11:17,507
COMMENCE FIRE!

1328
01:11:17,507 --> 01:11:19,509
OH, WAIT! I DON'T HAVE MY GUN!

1329
01:11:27,517 --> 01:11:30,219
A-HA, YOU'RE THE ONES WHO
SOLD ME MY ANTI-MISSILE ARMOR.

1330
01:11:31,754 --> 01:11:33,589
[ROARING]

1331
01:11:35,158 --> 01:11:37,360
AH, THIS IS REALLY
CLEANING MY PORES. THANK YOU!

1332
01:11:39,896 --> 01:11:41,831
MIKE, YOU'RE PROBABLY GRIPPED
WITH THE URGE TO SAY,

1333
01:11:41,831 --> 01:11:44,267
"LONDON BRIDGE IS FALLING DOWN,"
AT THIS POINT, BUT DON'T! DON'T!

1334
01:11:44,267 --> 01:11:46,369
THIS IS ACTUALLY
THE TOWER BRIDGE.

1335
01:11:47,503 --> 01:11:49,172
♪ LONDON BRIDGE
IS FALLING DOWN ♪

1336
01:11:49,172 --> 01:11:50,740
MIKE, WHAT DID
I JUST TELL YOU?

1337
01:11:50,740 --> 01:11:52,975
WHAT? OH, RIGHT. RIGHT.

1338
01:12:00,716 --> 01:12:02,652
- [SCREAMING]
- HEADS UP!

1339
01:12:05,421 --> 01:12:07,590
MY, THAT'S RIGHT BRACING,
GETTING KNOCKED OFF THE BRIDGE.

1340
01:12:11,661 --> 01:12:14,897
- OOH, RED ANTS!
- THE BRIDGE IS GONE!

1341
01:12:14,897 --> 01:12:17,967
 ONE OF LONDON'S
 OLDEST LANDMARKS
 SMASHED LIKE MATCHWOOD.

1342
01:12:17,967 --> 01:12:20,803
- A POWER DRILL.
- NOTHING CAN STOP THIS BEAST
 SO FAR, NOTHING!

1343
01:12:20,803 --> 01:12:23,206
 NOT EVEN
 POINT-BLANK CANNON FIRE!

1344
01:12:23,206 --> 01:12:25,074
YES. THE TOWER BRIDGE, SIR.

1345
01:12:25,074 --> 01:12:26,843
YES, THE POWER OF THIS THING
IS FANTASTIC!

1346
01:12:26,843 --> 01:12:29,245
- [ROARS]
- AND I'M ON HALF-POWER
AS IT IS!

1347
01:12:34,717 --> 01:12:38,154
HI. I'M GORGO.
BUT I'M NOT MORMO OF
THE THOUSAND-FACED MOON.

1348
01:12:42,525 --> 01:12:46,329
OOH, MAYBE MARY POPPINS
FLIES IN AND KICKS HIS ASS.

1349
01:12:46,329 --> 01:12:47,964
THAT I'D PAY TO SEE.

1350
01:12:54,070 --> 01:12:56,472
NO! HE HAS THE POWER
TO SUPERIMPOSE ROCKS!

1351
01:13:01,577 --> 01:13:04,046
CHECK THE MISSILE UNITS.
YES, SIR? HELLO.

1352
01:13:08,684 --> 01:13:10,453
[MULTIPLE SIRENS BLARING]

1353
01:13:10,453 --> 01:13:12,555
CLIFF RICHARDS
IS OPENING AT THE PALLADIUM!

1354
01:13:14,590 --> 01:13:16,492
JUGGLING PINS ARE BROUGHT IN,
AND THE MONSTER IS CHALLENGED

1355
01:13:16,492 --> 01:13:18,561
TO KEEP FIVE
UP IN THE AIR AT ONCE.

1356
01:13:21,330 --> 01:13:23,332
MEANWHILE, THE RUSSIANS
SLIP IN THE BACK DOOR, 

1357
01:13:23,332 --> 01:13:26,035
TAKE OVER LONDON AND
RENAME IT KHRUSCHEVGRAD.

1358
01:13:28,037 --> 01:13:30,506
THEY COULD FLING
REALLY HOT CURRY IN HIS EYES.

1359
01:13:30,506 --> 01:13:32,275
YEAH, OR SPRAY HIM
WITH MALT VINEGAR.

1360
01:13:32,275 --> 01:13:34,143
BACK, BACK, COME BACK!

1361
01:13:34,143 --> 01:13:36,779
YES, SIR, I WILL.

1362
01:13:36,779 --> 01:13:38,881
40 DEGREES, 61 UP!

1363
01:13:40,549 --> 01:13:42,351
HEY, IT'S LARGE BOB.

1364
01:13:42,351 --> 01:13:45,021
- IT'S BIG BEN.
- OH, SURE, MIKE.

1365
01:13:49,925 --> 01:13:53,729
- [ROARS]
- OOPS!

1366
01:13:53,729 --> 01:13:55,498
AH, YOU THINK IT'S NOTICEABLE?

1367
01:13:55,498 --> 01:13:57,066
NAH.

1368
01:13:57,066 --> 01:13:58,634
OH, BOY.

1369
01:13:58,634 --> 01:14:01,137
BIG BEN, [SCOFFS].

1370
01:14:01,137 --> 01:14:03,806
AH, IT WAS RUNNING
A LITTLE FAST ANYWAY.

1371
01:14:09,078 --> 01:14:11,547
[CHUCKLES]

1372
01:14:11,547 --> 01:14:17,286
GOT A FEW PEOPLE
CAUGHT IN MY TEETH.

1373
01:14:17,286 --> 01:14:19,355
COME ON.

1374
01:14:19,355 --> 01:14:22,491
I WANT ACCESS
TO THE LAW LIBRARY!

1375
01:14:22,491 --> 01:14:24,960
BURNED OUT OUR CONNECTION.

1376
01:14:24,960 --> 01:14:26,329
HERE, LET'S CHECK
HIS AIR PRESSURE.

1377
01:14:26,329 --> 01:14:29,765
MAYBE THAT'S THE PROBLEM.

1378
01:14:29,765 --> 01:14:33,436
WHERE'S SEAN?

1379
01:14:33,436 --> 01:14:35,471
AH, GENERAL SEAN,
GLAD WE FOUND YOU.

1380
01:14:39,608 --> 01:14:41,777
- SEAN!
- COME ON.

1381
01:14:41,777 --> 01:14:43,979
COME ON, WE HAVE TO RESCUE
OUR CHILD THAT WE HATE.

1382
01:14:48,517 --> 01:14:51,554
 ALL HOMES IN THIS AREA
 MUST BE EVACUATED AT ONCE!

1383
01:14:51,554 --> 01:14:52,855
THE DARLINGS!

1384
01:14:52,855 --> 01:14:55,124
 YOU HAVE NO TIME
 TO REMOVE YOUR BELONGINGS.

1385
01:14:55,124 --> 01:14:56,726
 GET OUT OF THE AREA.

1386
01:14:56,726 --> 01:14:59,261
 PROCEED IN A WESTERLY
 DIRECTION.

1387
01:14:59,261 --> 01:15:02,331
WELL, THE GOOD NEWS
IS HE MAY CRUSH STING.

1388
01:15:02,331 --> 01:15:07,003
- [SIGHS]
- GOOD NEWS FOR EVERYONE.

1389
01:15:07,003 --> 01:15:09,805
OH, A LOT OF PEOPLE WILL END UP
IN HOSPITAL BECAUSE OF THIS.

1390
01:15:09,805 --> 01:15:14,810
PERHAPS EVEN PEOPLE
FROM UNIVERSITY.

1391
01:15:14,810 --> 01:15:17,646
♪ DA-DA-DA
DA-DA-DA-DA-DA ♪

1392
01:15:23,986 --> 01:15:26,622
OH, NOT HER MAJESTY'S
CERTIFIED PAPERCLIP WORKS,

1393
01:15:26,622 --> 01:15:27,823
PURVEYORS OF PAPERCLIP

1394
01:15:27,823 --> 01:15:30,159
TO HER MAJESTY'S COURT
SINCE 1743.

1395
01:15:30,159 --> 01:15:33,462
 [HORN HONKS]

1396
01:15:33,462 --> 01:15:36,699
IT'S THE LONDON LANDMARK
BANCO ESPANOL.

1397
01:15:40,169 --> 01:15:42,438
HANG ON,
I GOTTA CHANGE SOME PESOS.

1398
01:15:46,709 --> 01:15:49,011
IT'S A LULU
AUTOGRAPH SESSION!

1399
01:15:57,853 --> 01:15:59,488
RUN THAT WAY, SAM.

1400
01:15:59,488 --> 01:16:01,090
WE'LL MEET BACK AT PATTERSON.

1401
01:16:01,090 --> 01:16:03,392
GREAT, ABOUT 4:00?
I'LL BRING SOME BEER.

1402
01:16:09,932 --> 01:16:13,669
WHAT, WHAT,
AM I OFFENDING? WHAT?

1403
01:16:13,669 --> 01:16:15,938
AH, MAYBE IT JUST HATES
GEORGIAN ARCHITECTURE.

1404
01:16:15,938 --> 01:16:18,541
COULD BE.

1405
01:16:18,541 --> 01:16:21,510
OOH, I HOPE THAT'S NOT
A MATING CALL.

1406
01:16:25,815 --> 01:16:27,650
I'M GLAD
YOU'RE KILLING MOTHER, GORGO.

1407
01:16:32,021 --> 01:16:33,389
WE NEED TO FIND ELTON JOHN

1408
01:16:33,389 --> 01:16:34,990
SO HE CAN WRITE
A SONG ABOUT THIS.

1409
01:16:34,990 --> 01:16:37,560
♪ GOODBYE, ENGLAND ♪

1410
01:16:37,560 --> 01:16:43,432
♪ YOU'VE BEEN CRUSHED
BY GIANT LIZARDS ♪

1411
01:16:43,432 --> 01:16:48,037
[SIGHS]
BIG BEN.

1412
01:16:48,037 --> 01:16:51,273
HEY, I'M JUST LOOKING
FOR A GOOD HAT BLOCKER.

1413
01:16:51,273 --> 01:16:53,075
♪♪

1414
01:16:58,113 --> 01:17:01,050
OOH!

1415
01:17:01,050 --> 01:17:03,986
WOW.

1416
01:17:03,986 --> 01:17:05,588
I ASSUME KING EDWARD HAS SOLD

1417
01:17:05,588 --> 01:17:07,857
ALL OF ENGLAND'S SECRETS
TO GORGO BY NOW.

1418
01:17:10,993 --> 01:17:12,695
MAN, YOU'RE A TUB, KID.

1419
01:17:16,365 --> 01:17:18,467
I WON'T MARRY YOU.

1420
01:17:18,467 --> 01:17:19,969
- AAH!
- YES, YOU WILL!

1421
01:17:23,572 --> 01:17:26,208
COME ON, MY CAR'S
GOING TO GET TOWED. MOVE!

1422
01:17:29,678 --> 01:17:34,016
AT THIS POINT,
HE'S USING THE KID
AS A BATTERING RAM.

1423
01:17:34,016 --> 01:17:35,317
YOU KNOW, IF IT WERE ME,

1424
01:17:35,317 --> 01:17:37,620
I'D JUST HANG BACK
AND KIND OF LOOK INCONSPICUOUS.

1425
01:17:37,620 --> 01:17:40,389
YEAH, DUCK INTO A CORNER,
PULL MY HAT DOWN,
READ THE PAPER.

1426
01:17:40,389 --> 01:17:42,024
YEAH.

1427
01:17:48,664 --> 01:17:53,435
AREN'T YOU GLAD
YOU USE DIAL?

1428
01:17:53,435 --> 01:17:57,706
THIS GUY PANICKED,
BUT HE STOPPED TO PACK.

1429
01:17:57,706 --> 01:18:01,644
♪ I'M LOOKING OVER
A FOUR-LEAF CLOVER ♪

1430
01:18:01,644 --> 01:18:07,016
STUBBY KAYE, AL LOUIS,
ARCHIE RICE.

1431
01:18:07,016 --> 01:18:09,685
- OOH, SCABBY KNEES.
- OUCH.

1432
01:18:18,794 --> 01:18:21,297
MY TRUSTY VENT-FIGURE
WILL GET ME THROUGH THIS.

1433
01:18:27,236 --> 01:18:29,705
OH, INSTI-FLOOD.

1434
01:18:29,705 --> 01:18:31,707
IT'S ALL RIGHT, SEAN.

1435
01:18:31,707 --> 01:18:32,708
WE'LL BE ALL RIGHT.

1436
01:18:32,708 --> 01:18:35,544
- EW, IT'S GORGO SWEAT.
- YUCK.

1437
01:18:41,450 --> 01:18:42,985
HEY, LOOK,
I DON'T WANT TO BE NEAR YOU.

1438
01:18:42,985 --> 01:18:44,253
TAKE ME BACK
TO THE SOLDIERS.

1439
01:18:44,253 --> 01:18:47,456
COME UP.

1440
01:18:47,456 --> 01:18:51,427
BY THE WAY, DOES THIS MEAN
NO WORK TOMORROW?

1441
01:18:51,427 --> 01:18:54,396
 [CAR HORNS HONKING]

1442
01:18:54,396 --> 01:18:57,232
OH, MAN, I FLOATED
AN AIR BISCUIT BACK THERE.

1443
01:18:57,232 --> 01:19:00,502
I GOTTA GET AWAY FROM IT.

1444
01:19:00,502 --> 01:19:02,438
THIS IS PICCADILLY,
THE HEART OF LONDON.

1445
01:19:02,438 --> 01:19:03,839
OH, I CAN'T DESCRIBE IT.

1446
01:19:03,839 --> 01:19:05,007
I'LL SPEAK IN WHOLE NUMBERS.

1447
01:19:05,007 --> 01:19:06,775
...NOT EVEN THE WORST
OF THE BLITZ.

1448
01:19:06,775 --> 01:19:08,911
THIS SECTION
IS COMPLETE SHAMBLES.

1449
01:19:08,911 --> 01:19:10,446
PEOPLE RUNNING MAD WITH FEAR.

1450
01:19:10,446 --> 01:19:12,815
BROKEN GAS MAINS,
FIRES EVERYWHERE.

1451
01:19:12,815 --> 01:19:15,851
THE FIRE DEPARTMENT
STILL RUNNING OVER PEOPLE.

1452
01:19:15,851 --> 01:19:17,586
HELLO, PICCADILLY.

1453
01:19:17,586 --> 01:19:20,189
FIRST I'M GONNA SEE
A NOËL COWARD PLAY
ON THE WEST END.

1454
01:19:24,493 --> 01:19:27,463
I'M SO PROUD.
MY SON'S NAME IN LIGHTS.

1455
01:19:30,332 --> 01:19:31,934
WHAT SHOULD I DO
WITH THIS BUILDING?

1456
01:19:31,934 --> 01:19:33,035
WELL, CRUSH IT, I GUESS.

1457
01:19:33,035 --> 01:19:37,239
IT'S WHAT I DO BEST.
THERE. YEAH.

1458
01:19:37,239 --> 01:19:39,275
PEOPLE ARE RUNNING
THROUGH THE STREETS SAYING,

1459
01:19:39,275 --> 01:19:40,909
"THIS SIMPLY ISN'T DONE.

1460
01:19:40,909 --> 01:19:45,981
YOU'LL BE HEARING
FROM MY SOLICITOR."

1461
01:19:45,981 --> 01:19:47,683
HE'S EVERYWHERE.

1462
01:19:47,683 --> 01:19:49,118
I CAN'T SEE ANYTHING NOW.

1463
01:19:49,118 --> 01:19:51,320
THERE'S TOO MUCH SMOKE.

1464
01:19:51,320 --> 01:19:53,589
HEY, KID, GIVE THAT GUY
IN THE WHEELCHAIR A LITTLE KICK.

1465
01:19:53,589 --> 01:19:57,059
HE'S IN OUR WAY.

1466
01:19:57,059 --> 01:19:58,093
PICCADILLY CIRCUS?

1467
01:19:58,093 --> 01:19:59,128
THERE'S NO WAY OF TELLING

1468
01:19:59,128 --> 01:20:02,931
WHERE THIS THING
WILL TURN NEXT.

1469
01:20:02,931 --> 01:20:04,366
BAH. UGH.

1470
01:20:04,366 --> 01:20:06,602
[LAUGHS]

1471
01:20:06,602 --> 01:20:08,137
I DON'T CARE
HOW IMPORTANT IT IS.

1472
01:20:08,137 --> 01:20:09,505
YOU MUST INTERRUPT.

1473
01:20:09,505 --> 01:20:12,141
IT'S IMPERATIVE THAT I SPEAK
TO THE MINISTER AT ONCE.

1474
01:20:12,141 --> 01:20:14,143
BUT THE MINISTER
NIPPED OUT TO BINGO.

1475
01:20:18,147 --> 01:20:22,851
AND THEY SNEAK OFF
AND BOMB THE FALKLANDS.

1476
01:20:22,851 --> 01:20:25,120
I WISH THEY'D GET BACK
TO DORKIN.

1477
01:20:25,120 --> 01:20:28,023
YEAH, THERE WAS A LOT OF DORKIN
AT THE BEGINNING OF THE MOVIE.

1478
01:20:28,023 --> 01:20:29,124
THEY SHOULD SHOW THAT
SOME MORE.

1479
01:20:29,124 --> 01:20:30,225
SURE. I MEAN, WELL,

1480
01:20:30,225 --> 01:20:31,260
WHO WOULDN'T
RATHER WATCH DORKIN

1481
01:20:31,260 --> 01:20:32,695
THAN THIS STOCK FOOTAGE?

1482
01:20:32,695 --> 01:20:36,265
HEY, I--I JUST REALLY, REALLY
LIKE TO WATCH PEOPLE DORKIN.

1483
01:20:36,265 --> 01:20:38,600
HEY,
THAT DOESN'T EVEN WORK.

1484
01:20:38,600 --> 01:20:40,402
OH, IT WORKS, MIKE.

1485
01:20:40,402 --> 01:20:42,838
THAT'S ENOUGH, YOU TWO.
ENOUGH DORKIN.

1486
01:20:42,838 --> 01:20:45,240
I--YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN.
STOP IT.

1487
01:20:45,240 --> 01:20:47,076
[ALL LAUGH]

1488
01:20:47,076 --> 01:20:48,677
ZINGO.

1489
01:20:51,280 --> 01:20:53,515
MAYBE THEY COULD DROP
ROBBIE COLTRANE ON HIM?

1490
01:20:53,515 --> 01:20:58,120
YEAH, OR HOW ABOUT
THE TWO FAT LADIES?

1491
01:20:58,120 --> 01:21:00,856
PACIFIST OR NOT, GANDHI'S
GOTTA BE CHUCKLING ABOUT NOW.

1492
01:21:03,959 --> 01:21:05,594
OH, LET ME GUESS.

1493
01:21:05,594 --> 01:21:08,397
THE AIR FORCE IS INEFFECTUAL.

1494
01:21:12,735 --> 01:21:15,938
BRING IT ON.
IT'S LIKE EATING PAD THAI.

1495
01:21:15,938 --> 01:21:20,109
STOP! REPENT! REPENT!

1496
01:21:20,109 --> 01:21:22,811
OH, NO.
IT'S WELL PASSED TEA.

1497
01:21:26,215 --> 01:21:28,250
REPENT! REPENT!

1498
01:21:28,250 --> 01:21:32,454
I'M NOT WEARING ANY PANTS.
NO PANTS, BABY!

1499
01:21:32,454 --> 01:21:36,091
MIKE, CAN ONE REPENT
IF ONE HASN'T YET PENTED?

1500
01:21:36,091 --> 01:21:37,860
- I'LL GET BACK TO YOU.
- OKAY.

1501
01:21:41,330 --> 01:21:42,898
I SEE.

1502
01:21:42,898 --> 01:21:44,433
WELL, LET ME KNOW
THE MOMENT YOU ARE.

1503
01:21:44,433 --> 01:21:45,601
YOU NEEDED
A VAUDEVILLE TEAM?

1504
01:21:45,601 --> 01:21:46,769
THANKS FOR COMING.

1505
01:21:46,769 --> 01:21:48,103
UNDOUBTEDLY HEADING
FOR BATTERSEA PARK, SIR.

1506
01:21:48,103 --> 01:21:49,171
THAT'S THE PLACE TO STOP IT.

1507
01:21:49,171 --> 01:21:50,439
HOW MUCH VOLTAGE
DO YOU ESTIMATE

1508
01:21:50,439 --> 01:21:52,741
WOULD BE REQUIRED FOR
ELECTROCUTING THIS ANIMAL?

1509
01:21:52,741 --> 01:21:55,477
TWO MILLION?
THREE MILLION VOTES?

1510
01:21:55,477 --> 01:21:57,913
IT'S ONLY A GUESS.
THERE ISN'T MUCH PRECEDENT
TO GO ON, SIR.

1511
01:21:57,913 --> 01:21:59,148
OH, THEN. OH.

1512
01:21:59,148 --> 01:22:01,717
GET ME BATTERSEA FIRE STATION.

1513
01:22:01,717 --> 01:22:03,752
UH, YOU BROUGHT THE WRONG KID.

1514
01:22:03,752 --> 01:22:04,853
IS HE OKAY?

1515
01:22:04,853 --> 01:22:06,822
SAY HELLO
TO THE NICE FOLKS, BOBBY.

1516
01:22:06,822 --> 01:22:10,959
HE'LL BE ALL RIGHT.

1517
01:22:10,959 --> 01:22:13,095
I USE TURTLE WAX
TO PREVENT CHIPPING.

1518
01:22:17,766 --> 01:22:18,967
TOENAIL FUNGUS.

1519
01:22:18,967 --> 01:22:20,903
YIKES.

1520
01:22:23,572 --> 01:22:25,474
SWITCH ON. FULL POWER.

1521
01:22:27,042 --> 01:22:29,411
AH, THEY GOT THE NEW
PUDDING MASTER 5,000.

1522
01:22:29,411 --> 01:22:31,046
AH.

1523
01:22:31,046 --> 01:22:33,482
♪ IF I RULED THE WORLD ♪

1524
01:22:33,482 --> 01:22:35,751
♪ EVERY DAY WOULD BE
THE FIRST DAY OF-- ♪

1525
01:22:35,751 --> 01:22:37,753
OW.
♪ SPRING ♪

1526
01:22:40,756 --> 01:22:43,091
OKAY, DROP IT.

1527
01:22:49,164 --> 01:22:53,702
MAN, THESE LITTLE
ARMY GUYS ARE CHEWY.

1528
01:22:53,702 --> 01:22:54,770
DIRECTOR HAD
A FOOT FETISH.

1529
01:22:58,774 --> 01:23:00,542
WE'RE WAITING AT...

1530
01:23:00,542 --> 01:23:02,578
WOULD YOU DIE?

1531
01:23:02,578 --> 01:23:04,613
...PRAYING FOR A MIRACLE.

1532
01:23:04,613 --> 01:23:06,815
THE ENTIRE ELECTRICITY
OF ALL INDUSTRIAL LONDON

1533
01:23:06,815 --> 01:23:08,083
HAVE BEEN DIVERTED
TO THE WIRES

1534
01:23:08,083 --> 01:23:09,952
SURROUNDING THE SMALL
ANIMAL'S ENCLOSURE.

1535
01:23:09,952 --> 01:23:11,086
WILL IT BE ENOUGH?

1536
01:23:11,086 --> 01:23:13,589
WILL IT BE ENOUGH TO STOP
THE HUGE BEAST?

1537
01:23:13,589 --> 01:23:15,390
WILL THE MIRACLE BE GRANTED?

1538
01:23:15,390 --> 01:23:17,960
OR WILL IT BE YET ANOTHER
OF MAN'S PUNY EFFORTS

1539
01:23:17,960 --> 01:23:20,896
TO OPPOSE THIS IRRESISTIBLE
FORCE OF ANCIENT NATURE?

1540
01:23:20,896 --> 01:23:23,699
AFTER THIS MESSAGE
FROM CADBURY.

1541
01:23:23,699 --> 01:23:26,235
HEY, SAM.

1542
01:23:26,235 --> 01:23:29,071
WEARIN' THE TIE I BOUGHT YOU.
[LAUGHS]

1543
01:23:32,474 --> 01:23:34,543
THE HELL
DO YOU WORK THIS THING?

1544
01:23:34,543 --> 01:23:38,647
[SIGHS]

1545
01:23:38,647 --> 01:23:40,883
MY SHIELD'S ALMOST DOWN.
HULL BREACH IMMINENT.

1546
01:23:47,990 --> 01:23:50,225
HE'S HEADING
FOR THE HOT TUB.

1547
01:23:55,130 --> 01:23:58,934
I'M RATHER PUT OUT
BY ALL THIS.

1548
01:23:58,934 --> 01:24:02,671
OH. WILL YOU QUIT
READJUSTING THE SUBWOOFER?

1549
01:24:02,671 --> 01:24:04,840
POWER CIRCUIT HAS JUST
BEEN COMPLETED, SIR.

1550
01:24:07,509 --> 01:24:09,411
[GRUNTS]

1551
01:24:09,411 --> 01:24:10,746
WHAT'S THE READING?

1552
01:24:10,746 --> 01:24:12,781
FOUR MILLION VOLTS
AND FULL AMPERAGE, SIR.

1553
01:24:12,781 --> 01:24:15,017
THE WIRES
WON'T TAKE ANYMORE.

1554
01:24:15,017 --> 01:24:17,252
GIVE ME BACK MY SON.

1555
01:24:19,454 --> 01:24:20,489
I LOVE YOU, MIMSY.

1556
01:24:26,662 --> 01:24:30,299
OH, BIG AMPERAGE.
HUH.

1557
01:24:30,299 --> 01:24:33,869
BOB,
YOU'RE EMBARRASSING ME.

1558
01:24:33,869 --> 01:24:36,972
[HUMMING]

1559
01:24:40,876 --> 01:24:43,645
OUR CAST,
IN CASE YOU FORGOT.

1560
01:24:45,914 --> 01:24:47,549
DORKIN.

1561
01:24:47,549 --> 01:24:49,952
SORRY.

1562
01:24:49,952 --> 01:24:52,921
SHE'S HURT.
SHE'S GOING DOWN!

1563
01:24:52,921 --> 01:24:55,390
OH, SHE'S TORN THE WIRES.

1564
01:24:57,926 --> 01:25:00,495
NOTHING CAN STOP HER NOW.
NOTHING.

1565
01:25:00,495 --> 01:25:02,164
I THINK THE EDITING
PHILOSOPHY OF THIS MOVIE

1566
01:25:02,164 --> 01:25:04,032
WAS "DON'T STAY
ON ANYTHING TOO LONG.

1567
01:25:04,032 --> 01:25:05,601
IT DOESN'T
LOOK GOOD ENOUGH."

1568
01:25:05,601 --> 01:25:07,269
MM-HMM.

1569
01:25:11,807 --> 01:25:14,009
AH, THIS IS TREATING
MY BI-POLAR DISORDER.

1570
01:25:18,313 --> 01:25:23,085
[IMITATING LAUGHTER]

1571
01:25:23,085 --> 01:25:26,254
[CONTINUES
IMITATING LAUGHTER]

1572
01:25:33,662 --> 01:25:37,966
YOU'RE COMING WITH ME,
YOUNG LIZARD.

1573
01:25:37,966 --> 01:25:41,303
OH.

1574
01:25:41,303 --> 01:25:43,739
DAMN, MOM, YOU'RE BIG.

1575
01:25:48,643 --> 01:25:51,146
- HEE-HEE.
- HEY.

1576
01:25:53,949 --> 01:25:56,485
KISS MY TAIL, ENGLAND.

1577
01:25:56,485 --> 01:25:58,320
WE PRAYED FOR A MIRACLE.

1578
01:25:58,320 --> 01:25:59,454
NOW TO CRICKETS COURSE.

1579
01:25:59,454 --> 01:26:01,256
MAYBE OUR PRAYERS
HAVE BEEN ANSWERED.

1580
01:26:01,256 --> 01:26:04,993
THE GREAT CITY,
OVERWHELMED, EXHAUSTED,

1581
01:26:04,993 --> 01:26:08,397
LIES HELPLESS UNDER THE
IMMEASURABLE POWER AND FEROCITY

1582
01:26:08,397 --> 01:26:10,665
OF THIS TOWERING APPARITION

1583
01:26:10,665 --> 01:26:12,034
FROM BEFORE
THE DAWN OF HISTORY.

1584
01:26:12,034 --> 01:26:13,735
WHY DIDN'T YOU
EAT THE ANNOUNCER?

1585
01:26:13,735 --> 01:26:18,840
AND YET, AS THOUGH DISDAINING
THE PYGMIES UNDER HER FEET,

1586
01:26:18,840 --> 01:26:20,342
SHE TURNS BACK.

1587
01:26:20,342 --> 01:26:21,376
YEAH, THAT'S ME.

1588
01:26:21,376 --> 01:26:23,712
TURNS WITH HER YOUNG.

1589
01:26:23,712 --> 01:26:25,313
LEAVING THE PROSTRATE CITY.

1590
01:26:25,313 --> 01:26:26,348
OOH.

1591
01:26:26,348 --> 01:26:27,849
LEAVING THE HAUNTS OF MAN.

1592
01:26:27,849 --> 01:26:30,952
AND LEAVING
MAN HIMSELF TO PONDER

1593
01:26:30,952 --> 01:26:32,454
THE PROUD BOAST

1594
01:26:32,454 --> 01:26:36,258
THAT HE ALONE IS LORD
OF ALL CREATION.

1595
01:26:36,258 --> 01:26:39,761
SHUT UP!

1596
01:26:39,761 --> 01:26:41,229
WIND BAG.

1597
01:26:41,229 --> 01:26:42,864
SO, MOM, HOW'S DAD?

1598
01:26:42,864 --> 01:26:45,000
- I ATE HIM.
- OH.

1599
01:26:45,000 --> 01:26:47,836
THEY'RE GOING BACK NOW.

1600
01:26:47,836 --> 01:26:49,438
BACK TO THE SEA.

1601
01:26:49,438 --> 01:26:51,473
WITH THE BLOOD OF MANY
ON HER SCALES.

1602
01:26:56,912 --> 01:26:58,013
COME ON, SON.

1603
01:26:58,013 --> 01:26:59,448
AS A TREAT,
LET'S GO CRUSH FRANCE.

1604
01:26:59,448 --> 01:27:00,916
HOORAY!

1605
01:27:00,916 --> 01:27:02,584
NOW THE REST OF THE STORY

1606
01:27:02,584 --> 01:27:05,020
IS THE KRAY BROTHERS
LOOTING LONDON.

1607
01:27:05,020 --> 01:27:07,155
THIS IS HOW MY GIANT ENDS.

1608
01:27:09,157 --> 01:27:11,626
[IMITATING SOUNDTRACK MUSIC]

1609
01:27:15,297 --> 01:27:18,233
OH, DORKIN WAS A PERSON,
A CHARACTER.

1610
01:27:18,233 --> 01:27:19,234
THAT'S WEIRD.

1611
01:27:19,234 --> 01:27:20,569
FIRST NAVAL OFFICER?

1612
01:27:20,569 --> 01:27:22,471
THERE WEREN'T ANY NAVAL OFFICERS
BEFORE THIS MOVIE?

1613
01:27:22,471 --> 01:27:24,506
I DON'T THINK HE WAS THE FIRST
NAVAL OFFICER EVER.

1614
01:27:24,506 --> 01:27:25,774
THAT'S PRECISELY
WHAT THEY'RE SAYING.

1615
01:27:25,774 --> 01:27:27,976
I DON'T THINK
THAT THAT'S IT.

1616
01:27:27,976 --> 01:27:29,010
ADMINISTRATION.

1617
01:27:29,010 --> 01:27:30,745
[LAUGHTER]

1618
01:27:42,557 --> 01:27:44,192
OH, DEAR, DEAR, DEAR.

1619
01:27:44,192 --> 01:27:45,760
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, MIKE.
LITTLE HELP HERE PLEASE.

1620
01:27:45,760 --> 01:27:46,862
YO.

1621
01:27:46,862 --> 01:27:48,263
YEAH, MIKE.
SLIGHT PROBLEM HERE.

1622
01:27:48,263 --> 01:27:50,365
YEAH, WE WENT AND PRESOLD
A SERIES OF CALENDARS

1623
01:27:50,365 --> 01:27:52,701
FEATURING THE HUNKS AND BABES
OF THE HIT FILM GORGO.

1624
01:27:52,701 --> 01:27:54,336
YEAH, SOLD IT
TO A NEW JERSEY FIRM,

1625
01:27:54,336 --> 01:27:56,438
ROUGH LOOKING GUYS IN DARK,
LATE-MODEL CARS.

1626
01:27:56,438 --> 01:27:57,506
AH, THE MOB.

1627
01:27:57,506 --> 01:27:58,874
- RIGHT, THE MOB.
- THE MOB. RIGHT.

1628
01:27:58,874 --> 01:28:00,709
EXACTLY. WELL, WE FILLED OUT
OUR HUNK CALENDAR

1629
01:28:00,709 --> 01:28:03,578
WITH THAT WILLIAM FRAWLEY GUY
YOU SEEMED TO LIKE SO MUCH.

1630
01:28:03,578 --> 01:28:05,680
WE HAD NO IDEA THERE WOULDN'T
BE A SINGLE WOMAN

1631
01:28:05,680 --> 01:28:06,648
IN THE WHOLE MOVIE.

1632
01:28:06,648 --> 01:28:07,682
RIGHT.
NOW THERE'S THE PROBLEM.

1633
01:28:07,682 --> 01:28:09,117
SAVE OUR LIVES.

1634
01:28:09,117 --> 01:28:10,785
OKAY.
SAVE YOUR LIVES.

1635
01:28:10,785 --> 01:28:12,621
UH, WELL, THERE ARE WOMEN
IN THE FILM.

1636
01:28:12,621 --> 01:28:14,856
I KNOW THAT. I'M JUST
NOT SURE THEY HAVE THE SIZZLE

1637
01:28:14,856 --> 01:28:15,991
FOR YOUR MOB CALENDAR.

1638
01:28:15,991 --> 01:28:17,626
HELL, WE'LL TAKE
WHAT WE CAN GET HERE.

1639
01:28:17,626 --> 01:28:18,827
UH, ALL RIGHT, WELL, CAMBOT,

1640
01:28:18,827 --> 01:28:20,395
LET'S HAVE A LOOK
AT THE MONITOR THERE.

1641
01:28:20,395 --> 01:28:21,730
IF I'M NOT MISTAKEN,

1642
01:28:21,730 --> 01:28:23,965
WHEN THE TWO GUYS ARE GETTING
OFF THE BOAT IN IRELAND,

1643
01:28:23,965 --> 01:28:25,967
I BELIEVE THERE WAS A WOMAN
STANDING RIGHT THERE.

1644
01:28:25,967 --> 01:28:27,002
CAN WE LOOK AT THAT?

1645
01:28:27,002 --> 01:28:28,270
OH, I THINK YOU'RE RIGHT.

1646
01:28:28,270 --> 01:28:29,271
HEY.

1647
01:28:29,271 --> 01:28:30,272
WHOA. HEY, YEAH.

1648
01:28:30,272 --> 01:28:31,706
YEAH.
THERE YOU GO.

1649
01:28:31,706 --> 01:28:33,542
I'M NOT SURE SHE'S FEATURED
IN THE FILM, HOWEVER.

1650
01:28:33,542 --> 01:28:34,543
AH, NOT A PROBLEM.

1651
01:28:34,543 --> 01:28:35,844
WE AIRBRUSH OUT
ANY BLEMISHES,

1652
01:28:35,844 --> 01:28:38,113
CLIP HER OUT AND PUT HER
ON THE HOOD OF A LAMBORGHINI,

1653
01:28:38,113 --> 01:28:39,114
WE GOT MISS JULY.

1654
01:28:39,114 --> 01:28:40,615
- RIGHT.
- NEXT.

1655
01:28:40,615 --> 01:28:42,450
OH, OKAY. UH, GORGO'S CHASING
PEOPLE THROUGH THE STREETS.

1656
01:28:42,450 --> 01:28:43,485
BUNCH OF CROWD SCENES THERE.

1657
01:28:43,485 --> 01:28:44,719
I THINK
THERE'S A WOMAN THERE.

1658
01:28:44,719 --> 01:28:47,389
CAMBOT,
CAN WE FAST FORWARD TO THAT?

1659
01:28:47,389 --> 01:28:49,090
- NO--YEAH--
- AH, YES.

1660
01:28:49,090 --> 01:28:50,125
- THERE YOU GO.
- PERFECT.

1661
01:28:50,125 --> 01:28:51,359
CHANGE HER HAIR,

1662
01:28:51,359 --> 01:28:53,595
PUT HER IN FRONT OF A FIREPLACE
AT A RUGGED LODGE,

1663
01:28:53,595 --> 01:28:54,663
WE GOT A BEST-SELLER.

1664
01:28:54,663 --> 01:28:55,897
GUYS ARE ON YOUR WAY.
OKAY.

1665
01:28:55,897 --> 01:28:57,766
WELL, BACK TO YOU,
LEONARD MALTIN.

1666
01:28:57,766 --> 01:28:59,568
WHY AREN'T THEY SUFFERING?

1667
01:28:59,568 --> 01:29:01,069
WHAT'S THE DEAL, LEO?

1668
01:29:01,069 --> 01:29:02,070
I DON'T UNDERSTAND IT.

1669
01:29:02,070 --> 01:29:03,371
UH, IN MANY CASES,

1670
01:29:03,371 --> 01:29:05,507
 GORGO HAS BEEN KNOWN
TO INDUCE HALLUCINATIONS

1671
01:29:05,507 --> 01:29:07,609
AND MILD DROOLING,
AT THE VERY LEAST.

1672
01:29:07,609 --> 01:29:09,177
WELL, YOU BETTER
START UNDERSTANDING.

1673
01:29:09,177 --> 01:29:11,112
I WANT THE WORST MOVIE
EVER MADE,

1674
01:29:11,112 --> 01:29:13,582
AND I WANT IT NOW, REX REED.

1675
01:29:13,582 --> 01:29:15,050
NO, JUST HOLD YOUR WATER.
LET ME SEE.

1676
01:29:15,050 --> 01:29:16,918
I WANNA HURT 'EM
AS MUCH AS YOU DO.

1677
01:29:16,918 --> 01:29:18,453
GOTTA BE SOMETHING
REALLY BAD.

1678
01:29:18,453 --> 01:29:19,955
WORST MOVIE.

1679
01:29:19,955 --> 01:29:21,389
I WOULD THINK SOMETHING
WITH MICKEY ROURKE.

1680
01:29:21,389 --> 01:29:22,490
OH, YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.

1681
01:29:22,490 --> 01:29:23,592
NOW YOU'RE TALKING.

1682
01:29:23,592 --> 01:29:26,294
CROSS-REFERENCE THAT
WITH ERIC ROBERTS

1683
01:29:26,294 --> 01:29:27,996
AND WE'RE IN BUSINESS.

1684
01:29:27,996 --> 01:29:29,331
YOU'RE DEAD, NELSON.

1685
01:29:29,331 --> 01:29:30,665
YEAH, I THINK SO.

1686
01:29:30,665 --> 01:29:32,701
YOU KNOW, USING MY NEW,
UPDATED MOVIE AND VIDEO GUIDE,

1687
01:29:32,701 --> 01:29:34,035
WE'LL FIND
THE WORST MOVIE EVER,

1688
01:29:34,035 --> 01:29:38,073
AND THEN
IT'S CURTAINS FOR YOU.

1689
01:29:38,073 --> 01:29:39,507
WHAT DID YOU SAY
YOUR NAME WAS?

1690
01:29:39,507 --> 01:29:41,576
UH, MALTIN.
LEONARD MALTIN.

1691
01:29:41,576 --> 01:29:42,978
I LIKE YOU, LEONARD.

1692
01:29:42,978 --> 01:29:45,213
[LAUGHS]

1693
01:30:49,077 --> 01:30:51,212
[SHOUTS]
